_:ne674dbb8e37e48419bae2ca5ac6d1af7xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Andaz Capital Gate Abu Dhabi - a concept by Hyatt is situated in the famous Capital Gate building within walking distance from the Exhibition centre and 5 minutes drive from The Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque. Location in the embassy and government district makes it ideal for business travellers, while distance within 15 minutes away from Corniche and Abu Dhabi International Airport makes the hotel an ideal hub for leisure travellers. The Yas Marina Circuit and the Ferrari World are a 30-minute drive from the hotel. It offers luxury rooms with floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the city. It features 2 bars, 1 restaurant, lounge and a spa with panoramic views.The air-conditioned rooms and suites at the Andaz feature a flat-screen TV and an MP3 docking station. They all offer panoramic views of the city and a deep soaking tub.Suspended 19 floors above the ground the new POOL bar with both indoor and outdoor seating spaces, the venue offers stunning views over Abu Dhabi city and the Gulf, perfect for sundowners and unwinding in the evenings. Lounge, Located on the 18th floor stands as an icon of refinement and renewed style. With its combination of comfortable, lounge-style seating and a more intimate library area, the Lounge offers an eclectic spread of premium tea, coffee, fresh pastries, and snacks. The Rayana Spa is located on the 19th floor and is the only one in Abu Dhabi overlooking the city. It features a suspended outdoor swimming pool, a fitness centre and a whirlpool."
