_:n198715daeb9f48eb8367bab56897e2a0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Aloft London Excel is a bold hotel featuring loft-inspired design in the hip East End with an indoor pool. Meet and mingle with friends at our W XYZ bar, grab a sweet, savoury, or healthy snack from ReFuel by Aloft, our 24 hour pantry or play in our ReMix lounge. Plus, you can always stay connected with free hotel wide wireless high-speed Internet Access! Breeze into one of our Aloft rooms, featuring our ultra-comfortable signature bed, walk-in shower, custom amenities, and more. Our connectivity station charges all your electronics and links to the 49-inch LCD TV to maximise work and play. With several fast rail links into Central London, we are located close to both the Docklands Light Railway DLR and the Elizabeth line. Reach the East London hub of Stratford in 30 minutes with the DLR, alongside excellent links into Canary Wharf on the Jubilee line. The Elizabeth line is just a 10-minute walk from the hotel, which can take you into Central London in 20 minutes and to Heathrow Airport in just 45 minutes.  "
