_:n551f47b1692847c888f66ef795407cbbxb0	http://schema.org/description	"JW Marriott Hotel Medan welcomes you to Indonesia with refined luxury and a prime location in the citys central business district. Our Medan, Indonesia, hotel holds the distinction of being Medan's first and only five star international hotel, providing a memorable setting for business and leisure travelers. Take time to explore local historical or culinary sites like Istana Maimoon, Tjong A Fie and Merdeka Walk from our hotel near Grand Mosque. Maintain your fitness with a workout in our 24-hour hotel gym or take an invigorating swim in our outdoor infinity pool. Savor delicious cuisines and signature drinks at our on-site restaurants, or relax in our Executive Lounge and enjoy 180-degree views of the city. We're pleased to offer the largest pillar-free ballroom in Medan, as well as nine other venues for your next meeting or event. Our hotel rooms and suites are designed with plush bedding, modern technology and picturesque views of the Medan skyline. Your five-star escape awaits at JW Marriott Hotel Medan. "
