_:n454108ed53ce47f88e5735e60bbd92c1xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Boasting a private beach and surrounded by tropical gardens, Hyatt Regency Bali is located in Sanur. Guests enjoy garden view from the elegant rooms. This beachfront resort also houses 3 dining options and 3 outdoor pools. Appointed with wooden furnishings, each room comes with modern amenities such as a flat-screen TV and coffee/tea making facilities. The private balcony or terrace includes a daybed. Shower facilities and a hairdryer are available in the en suite bathroom. Certain rooms have lounge access. Local and international favorites are served at Omang Omang, such as seafood dishes and meat grill. The seaside Pizzaria specialises in Italian cuisine, while drinks and live entertainment are offered at the relaxing Piano Lounge. The resort has extensive wellness facilities, including a 24-hour gym, a spa and a sauna. Families can play in the pool or explore the beach. Friendly staff at the reception are happy to assist you with room service, currency exchange and day trips. Hyatt Regency Bali is 15 km from Bali Zoo and is 28 km from Bali Safari and Marine Park. Bali Beach Golf Course is 3 km from the resort. Ngurah Rai International Airport is 14 km away."
