_:nbb6c1dc64eda45bd8710f57025a42dc9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located in Hohola, the emerging Government District, Hilton Port Moresby Hotel and Residences is a midway point between Jacksons International Airport and the Port Moresby waterfront. The Hotel and Residence is part of the Star Mountain Plaza development, a secure complex with 24-hour monitored and patrolled security services. The precinct features a unique Cultural Trail celebrating the rich heritage of Papua New Guinea, showcasing the artwork and memorabilia that represent the country's lifestyle and culture. Adjacent to the hotel is the Kutubu Convention Center, offering a wide range of event spaces from a boardroom for 10 to a convention-style open space for 800 guests. The Convention Center is within the same precinct and is connected to the hotel via a short walkway. Visual display screens are prominent throughout the hotel and can also be used for corporate or social event purposes. Relax in a modern guest room featuring floor-to-ceiling windows, a 50-inch HDTV, and an ergonomic workspace. Select an executive room or suite for added space, stunning views, and extra amenities. The top floor of the hotel is home to an exclusive Executive Lounge and the unique Summit venue providing a top-quality retreat to relax, meet friends and enjoy fine wines, beers, spirits, and cocktails. Rejuvenate in our two fitness centers offering the latest cardio and resistance equipment, or take a dip in our two outdoor pools. Experience traditional Papua New Guinea dining at Mumu, our indoor/outdoor venue featuring live cooking stations with a Mumu oven - a traditional earthenware oven from the highlands of Papua New Guinea. Enjoy all-day dining at Feast, including an extensive Sunday brunch, or join fellow sports fans and watch the latest match on the big screen in the Copper sports lounge."
