_:n0df4213a930e40b1a32930515a98f291xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated on the sunny shoreline of the Arabian Gulf Hilton Kuwait Resort is set on 1.7 km of private beach and is ideal for business and leisure travelers. Just 10 km from Kuwait's oil district and a 20-minute drive from camp Arafijan make it the perfect spot for business travelers. Leisure guests can enjoy a unique shopping experience at the Al Kout Mall featuring Kuwait's largest indoor go-cart circuit. The Gate Mall, 360 Mall and the prestigious mall The Avenues can be reached within 30 minutes of our resort. The resort features a state-of-the-art spa with an aqua medic pool and private treatment rooms. Guests can relax in the indoor or outdoor pools. For those who like to keep fit there is a 24-hour fitness center on site. A Kids' Paradise and playground area is also available. Guests enjoy a unique dining experience with every meal. Indulge in International innovative cuisines at the Teatro Restaurant or savor Arabic cuisine with shisha at Palm Court. Song Bird cafe is ideal for a quick bite in between. Choose from a variety of comfortable and stylish accommodations which feature complimentary WiFi and a minibar with tea and coffee making facilities. The hotel offers complimentary airport transportation to and from the airport. The journey takes approximately 20 minutes."
