_:naf65271c716348498b48073709e6571fxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Chiang Mai, 3.1 km from Chiang Mai 700th Anniversary Stadium, Raya Heritage features rooms with garden views and free WiFi. Featuring a restaurant, the property also has an outdoor swimming pool, as well as a fitness centre. Chiang Mai International Convention and Exhibition Centre is 3.4 km away and Chiang Mai Zoo is 6 km from the hotel. All rooms at the hotel come with a seating area, a flat-screen TV with cable channels and a private bathroom with free toiletries and a bath. Each room includes air conditioning, and certain units at Raya Heritage have a balcony. All guest rooms feature a wardrobe. An à la carte breakfast can be enjoyed at Khu Khao restaurant. Chang Puak Market is 6 km from the accommodation, while Kad Suan Kaew Shopping Centre is 6 km away. The nearest airport is Chiang Mai International Airport, 9 km from Raya Heritage. Raya Heritage will be undertaking improvement to Baan Ta Lounge & Lawn restaurant from March 11 – 26, 2024 (inclusive). The renovation work will take place daily between the hours of 10:00 to 16:00hrs. During this period, Baan Ta Lounge & Lawn and Laan Cha Tea Terrace restaurants will be closed and the operation hours for Ai Waan Spa will be changed from 10:00-22:00 hrs to 16:30-23:00 hrs. The restaurants will be reopened on March 27, 2024 and the operation hours for spa will be from 10:00 - 22:00hrs as normal."
