_:n43e65264592f45e39f2505cbb6451b1dxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Welcome to Hilton Garden Inn Yalova, a sea shore city surrounded by a natural forest and park. Our Yalova hotel is located on the main highway from Istanbul Yalova and Bursa, just 1.5 km from the city center and an hour from Sabiha Gokcen International Airport. Start the morning with a delicious buffet breakfast at the Garden Grille. Our restaurant is open all day and we also have Evening Room Service and a 24-hour Shop for refreshments. Work out in the complimentary 24-hour fitness center or go for a swim in our pool. Along with a 24-hour Business Center, we have over 900 sq. ft. of versatile meeting space that’s perfect for corporate and social events."
