_:n35d68e786ad744b08c33c4bce7e16bc9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Agadir, 600 metres from Agadir Beach, Mabrouk Hotel and Suites- Adult only features accommodation with a restaurant, free private parking, an outdoor swimming pool and a bar. With a garden, the 4-star hotel has air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi, each with a private bathroom. The accommodation offers a 24-hour front desk and room service for guests. At the hotel, every room includes a wardrobe. At Mabrouk Hotel and Suites- Adult the rooms include a desk and a flat-screen TV. Guests at the accommodation can enjoy a à la carte breakfast. Mabrouk Hotel and Suites- Adult only offers a terrace. Popular points of interest near the hotel include Amazighe Heritage Museum, House of Activities Association Club and Tamazert. The nearest airport is Agadir–Al Massira, 24 km from Mabrouk Hotel and Suites- Adult only, and the property offers a paid airport shuttle service. We would like to inform our guests that the property is not family friendly and the entertainment with loud music lasts until 2.00 AM by the swimming pool. Please be informed also that some rooms are close to the club and might be annoyed by the noise."
