_:n78b8df13346f45f599eb79cd16ad7098xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Millennium Hilton Bangkok is a riverfront sanctuary in proximity to the heart of the city and cultural district with a spectacular view of the Chao Phraya River from every guest room and suite. The hotel offers a fresh perspective of life and is close to a vibrant network of streets filled with art galleries, museums, and authentic markets. Conveniently located within a short walking distance from the BTS Gold Line Charoen Nakhon station the property can be easily reached via a cross-river ferry from the Si Phaya Pier next to the River City Bangkok shopping center. ICONSIAM, one of the largest shopping malls in Asia, is just a few minutes’ walk from the hotel. Enjoy a scenic ride along the Chao Phraya River with our complimentary shuttle boat from the hotel's private pier to Saphan Taksin BTS Skytrain station daily from 6 am to 9.45 pm. This 32-storey landmark by the bank of the Chao Phraya River features 533 guest rooms, which are elegantly appointed with upscale amenities, oversized bathrooms, and panoramic river views. The riverside all-day-dining restaurant, Flow provides a wide variety of international menu selections. While ThreeSixty Jazz Lounge and ThreeSixty Rooftop Bar remain, the hotel highlight for a perfect evening."
