_:n1dad22a543614a6082c3efc797f3d554xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Location This hotel is situated in a superb location about 3 km from Torremolinos. It is located close to the new Benelmadena complex and the city is accessed along a promenade. The centre is 2.5 km from the hotel and there are a range of wonderful bars and restaurants in the surrounding area. Facilities The establishment comprises a total of 293 accommodation units. A lobby and a reception are available to guests. The upper floors are easily accessible using the lift. Services and facilities at the hotel include internet access, wireless internet access, a restaurant, a bar, a playroom and a laundry. A garden is among the features contributing to a pleasant stay. Parking facilities available to guests include a garage and a car park. A bicycle hire service (for a fee) gives guests the opportunity to explore the surrounding area independently. Rooms All accommodation units feature air conditioning, central heating, a fan and a bathroom. A balcony or terrace can be found in most rooms. Many of the rooms also offer a sea view, adding to the ambience. Extra beds can be requested. A safe (surcharge) and a minibar also feature. Each accommodation unit offers a telephone, a TV and wireless internet access. Each of the bathrooms features a shower, a bathtub, a hairdryer and tiles. Each accommodation unit includes a bathroom with tiles. Sports/Entertainment A refreshing dip in the indoor or outdoor pool can be pleasantly cooling on hot days. A terrace, a sun terrace, sun loungers and parasols are available. A hot tub provides an opportunity for relaxation. There is also a poolside snack bar. Variety is offered by the range of leisure options offered at the establishment. These include golf, or for a fee, cycling/mountain biking, tennis and horse riding. A gym and table tennis, or for a fee, squash are among the sport and leisure options available at the establishment. Various wellness options are offered, including a spa, a sauna, a steam bath and massage treatments. Entertainment options and leisure facilities include an entertainment programme and live music. Meals The establishment offers the following bookable meals and board options: breakfast, dinner and half board. Staff are also happy to prepare vegetarian dishes. Special deals can be enjoyed at the establishment. Guests can enjoy the show cooking, during which the chefs create delicious specialities. Payment The following credit cards are accepted at the establishment: American Express, VISA, Diners Club and MasterCard."
