_:n3aa71f65fbb94172b701be68779ba95cxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Featuring an indoor pool, a spa and 5 dining options on site, Mandarin Oriental Pudong, Shanghai offers accommodation in Shanghai. It is only a 10-minute walk from Oriental Pearl TV Tower and Lujiazui Subway Station (line2). The hotel is a 20-minute drive from the Bund, when both Hongqiao Railway Station and Hongqiao International Airport is a 1-hour drive away. Fitted with air conditioning and carpeted flooring, soundproofing rooms here feature an iPod dock, a flat-screen TV with cable and satellite channels, sofa, minibar, fridge, coffee machine and an electric kettle. Coming with both bathtub and shower facilities, private bathroom also includes bathrobes and slippers. Guests can enjoy a soothing massage at the spa, or do exercise in the fitness centre. There is a 24-hour front desk and a tour desk at Mandarin Oriental Pudong, where car hire, ticketing service, currency exchange and luggage storage are available. The hotel also provides a cash machine, a business centre and laundry service."
