_:n8135405f6afc41d3870c46dc9b965372xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hagia Sofia Mansions Istanbul Curio Collection by Hilton provides a unique hotel experience steps from Istanbuls major cultural landmarks. Comprising of individual mansions located in the heart of the historic city center, our property boasts an excellent location near Hagia Sophia, Topkapi Palace, Hippodrome Square, Blue Mosque, and Basilica Cistern. The Sultanahmet Tramway Station and Sirkeci Metro Station are minutes away. Our spacious guest rooms offer 48 inch HDTVs, and large bathrooms complete with deep soaking tubs and separate Turkish Bath showers. Suites feature a separate living area with sofa bed, two HDTVs, and indulgent marble master bathrooms. All accommodations include complimentary WiFi. When booking for multiple guests, rooms can be allocated in the same mansion creating an exclusive building for your party to the based on availability. Dine at our open air Green House Garden Restaurant and Bar, featuring an enchanting stone fountain, lush greenery, and fresh local favorites. Enjoy a la carte and buffet breakfast in the morning, and high tea in the afternoons. Relax with a cup of coffee, or delight in Shisha. Later savor aperitifs and beverages at our speakeasy-style Garden Bar."
