_:n7f477d11c43c4e10afbf293a9fb68547xb0	http://schema.org/description	"<p>Located very close to the Abu Dhabi airport and connected to the convention center, Andaz Capital Gate, Abu Dhabi is a distinctive hotel that has a truly unique architectural design. Inside are luxurious finishes, state-of-the-art amenities, and even the hotel's own art gallery.</p>\n\n<p>This stunning hotel features an outdoor pool surrounded by sun loungers. You can work out around the clock in the on-site fitness center. There's a full-service spa that has several treatment rooms and a steam room, and everything you'll need to conduct your business. Plus, you can find concierge services for help with area information, and the staff speaks 16 different languages.</p>\n\n<p>None of the 188 rooms is anything less than impressive. You'll have floor-to-ceiling windows so you can enjoy views of the city, bathrooms that are finished in marble and other high-end materials, and Illy espresso machines to use. The suites are the ultra choice for luxury, but rooms are impressive, as well. You'll still get to enjoy the deep soaking tubs, rainfall showers, and panoramic views, just with a bit less space.</p>\n\n<p>18 Degrees is the award-winning restaurant at Andaz Capital Gate, Abu Dhabi. It offers exquisite Mediterranean cuisine that's traditionally based but with modern twists. It includes an outdoor terrace with amazing views out over the city. You'll also have the Andaz Lounge where you grab a drink and a snack.</p>\n\n<p>Andaz Capital Gate, Abu Dhabi is in the center of the city. You can easily walk to the Abu Dhabi National Exhibition Centre, the Miraj Museum, and Sheikh Zayed Stadium. Other attractions a little further from the hotel include Mangrove Lagoon National Park and Abu Dhabi Golf Club.</p>"
