_:n026aa5796d2c423da7da09e14632f137xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Bristol, this 4-star property is modern and contemporary. It is steps from Temple Church, eateries and nightlife options.\n\nHilton Garden Inn Bristol City Centre offers a 24/7 reception, as well as free Wi-Fi and room service. For a quick and effortless check-in and departure experience, guests can benefit from the express check-in/check-out feature.\n\nThe stylish rooms at the hotel offer floor-to-ceiling windows, a flat-screen TV and a desk. They are air conditioned and provide tea and coffee making facilities, a refrigerator and a private bathroom. The bathrooms feature a shower and come with a hair dryer.\n\nHilton Garden Inn Bristol City Centre provides an on-site restaurant, Recess, which offers breakfast, lunch and dinner in an award-winning setting. Each evening, guests are welcome to wind down in the lounge bar.\n\nThe hotel offers parking for guests and is an easy car ride from Bristol City Museum and Art Gallery. Bristol Harbour and Cabot Circus are each within walking distance."
