_:n6c0ce6d513d245e59c7c941f0c15f0eaxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hyatt Regency Casablanca is situated in Casablanca and is close to the area's well-known attractions. Guests have access to an outdoor pool, a sun deck and a sauna.\n\nThere are a range of facilities available to guests of Hotel Hyatt Regency Casablanca, such as a kids pool, valet parking and an express check-in and check-out feature. It also provides child-minding services, a currency exchange and a reception that operates 24/7. The hotel also offers a well-equipped fitness center.\n\nThere are 255 elegant rooms at Hyatt Regency Casablanca, each offering all the necessities to ensure a comfortable stay. A mini bar, a refrigerator and ironing facilities can also be found in each.\n\nHyatt Regency Casablanca offers a varied dining experience with Les Bougainvillées and The Living Room. In the evening, guests are invited to wind down in the comfortable lounge bar. A wide variety of eating options are also found in the area.\n\nAttractions near Hotel Hyatt Regency Casablanca include Stade Larbi Benbarek and Casablanca Cathedral. Hassan II Mosque, Casablanca Twin Center and Port of Casablanca are in close proximity to the property."
