_:na4a71d72e80440d1b01f80d8d7d7a64axb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Denpasar, Aston Denpasar Hotel And Convention Center is an easy drive from Sanur Beach and offers on-site parking. It features a fitness center, as well as free Wi-Fi, a swimming pool and 24-hour room service.\n\nA wide range of premium services are available for guests of Aston Denpasar Hotel And Convention Center, like 24-hour security, a car rental desk and a 24-hour business centre. Staff are available 24 hours a day and can assist with booking tours and tickets.\n\nThe hotel features air conditioned rooms with a mini bar, a coffee maker and a flat-screen TV. They offer a seating area, an in-room safe and a desk.\n\nAston Denpasar Hotel And Convention Center's restaurant offers the convenience of on-site dining, with a variety of Halal meals on offer.\n\nNgurah Rai International Airport is a 25-minute drive from the hotel. Legian Beach and Jalan Legian are close by."
