_:n8e396bb7b80c499cafbb10053218e300xb0	http://schema.org/description	"<p>The Prime Plaza Suites Sanur - Bali is a family resort that's been recognized in five consecutive years as one of Indonesia's Top 25 Best Hotels for Families. The property is only 25 minutes from Denpasar International Airport, and you'll be able to walk into the village, go shopping, and find many local restaurants to try, with ease.</p>\n\n<p>This resort takes good care of all guests but caters to families in particular. There's a free children's club, a children's pool with water slides, a playground, and in-room childcare that can be booked so parents can get some alone time. Adults can book massages and other spa treatments, work out in the fitness center, and enjoy two other outdoor pools. You can also explore the area through a free shuttle service provided by the hotel.</p>\n\n<p>The Prime Plaza Suites Sanur-Bali has 84 apartments on offer. You can choose from one- and two-bedroom suites, and three-bedroom suites with balconies or lofts included. The three-bedroom units can accommodate up to six adults plus a child. The rooms have many features that make them home-like. You'll have a well-appointed kitchen, a flat-screen TV with cable, free Wi-Fi, and much more.</p>\n\n<p>Terrace Restaurant at the Prime Plaza Suites Sanur - Bali is open all day and offers outdoor dining and themed buffets. There's also the Pool Bar where you can find cocktails and some light meals and snacks.</p>\n\n<p>Some places you can walk to check out in the area are the Sanur Night Market and the Bali Beach Golf Course. You can also hop on the shuttle to visit Benoa Harbour that's about six miles away.</p>"
