_:n3f01962f72974ef7b2c288bc354659cdxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Offering a Jacuzzi, a sauna and an indoor pool, Hotel Nikko Fukuoka is located in Fukuoka and is a brief stroll from Hakata-ku. The hotel is also conveniently situated within walking distance of Hakata Railway Station.\n\nHotel Nikko Fukuoka has been recently refurbished and offers a concierge, a coffee bar and a 24-hour reception. The in-house spa provides a variety of treatments and a chance to relax. The hotel also features a well-equipped fitness center.\n\nNikko Fukuoka Hotel provides contemporary rooms equipped with a flat-screen TV, a mini bar and a refrigerator. They all offer internet access, slippers and movies-on-demand.\n\nNikko Hotel Fukuoka provides a varied dining experience with Serena and Tea & Cocktail Lounge. Each evening, guests are welcome to wind down in the cozy lounge bar. A selection of eating options can also be found in the area.\n\nIt is just a short stroll from Gion Train Station, providing easy access to the rest of the city. Fukuoka Airport is a 20-minute drive away."
