_:n42f78cdbda09405681af709ae6569f63xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Offering a private beach, an outdoor pool and outdoor tennis courts, this luxury resort is an easy car ride from Zihuatanejo. It also features an all-inclusive meal plan, a sauna and an express check-in and check-out feature.\n\nThis 5-star resort provides a kids club, a kids pool and a 24-hour reception. Airport transfers, a laundry service, babysitting/child services and a dry cleaning service are available upon request.\n\nThe rooms at Azul Ixtapa All Inclusive Resort were renovated in 2003 and feature wireless internet access and a telephone. There are also honeymoon suites available.\n\nAzul Ixtapa All Inclusive Resort's in-house restaurant provides a convenient option for those wishing to dine in. Guests looking to relax with a drink can do so in the on-site bar.\n\nIxtapa-Zihuatanejo International Airport is a 30-minute drive from Azul Ixtapa All Inclusive Resort. Ixtapa Island is within walking distance."
