_:n1cad6008c5f34dd29befd9ae93900eb7xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hotel Phillips Kansas City Curio Collection By Hilton is located in Kansas City and is within a short walk of local attractions, such as Kansas City Power & Light District, Kansas City Convention Center and Sprint Center. Guests can also enjoy free internet access throughout the property.\n\nThere are a variety of facilities on offer to those staying at the hotel, including an express check-in and check-out feature, a 24-hour business centre and valet parking. The front desk operates 24/7 and the friendly staff can recommend places to visit and provide other tourist information.\n\nThere are 217 rooms at Hotel Phillips Kansas City Curio Collection By Hilton, each providing all the essentials to ensure a comfortable stay. Interconnecting rooms are also offered.\n\nThe hotel has an on-site restaurant, perfect for guests who prefer to eat in. Alternatively, there are plenty of other dining options in the local area.\n\nHotel Phillips Kansas City Curio Collection By Hilton is within walking distance of Union Station, connecting guests with the surrounding area. Grace and Holy Trinity Cathedral and Quality Hill are also within a 10-minute walk."
