_:nec1a389cf8a64c5e992a32798518a2d4xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Cozy and modern, Mercure Kuta Bali is located in Kuta and offers a Jacuzzi, an infinity pool and outdoor tennis courts. It also provides a rooftop terrace and free wired internet.\n\nGuests can enjoy a range of relaxing treatments and beauty therapy at the in-house spa and wellness center, Bali. Convenient services include an express check-in/check-out feature and a luggage storage facility.\n\nThe contemporary rooms are air-conditioned and feature soundproofed windows, a mini bar, a refrigerator and slippers. They come with movies-on-demand, a flat-screen TV and a private bathroom.\n\nKuta Mercure Hotel provides a varied dining experience with Alang Alang and Lotus. For those on the move, the hotel offers packed lunches if required.\n\nNgurah Rai International Airport is just a 15-minute drive from Mercure Kuta, and a shuttle service is available for guests. There are a variety of shopping, dining and nightlife options close by, and Waterbom Bali and Jalan Legian are a short drive away."
