_:na72062de02414cddb90f859228425747xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Launceston CBD, Hotel Grand Chancellor Launceston is within a 10-minute walk of Queen Victoria Museum and Art Gallery and Launceston City Park. It also features an executive floor, a coffee bar and 24-hour room service.\n\nThere are a range of amenities available to those staying at Grand Chancellor Hotel Launceston, including kids club, 24-hour business centre and car hire. Welcoming and professional team members are available 24 hours a day.\n\nGrand Chancellor Launceston has 165 well-appointed rooms that are filled with a variety of essential amenities to ensure guests have an enjoyable stay. Each one features a flat-screen TV with satellite / cable channels, as well as a private en suite.\n\nBars and dining options surrounding this hotel are plentiful as it is positioned in the center of Launceston's popular nightlife district. It is also within walking distance of Aurora Stadium and Launceston Aquatic."
