_:n0ecfb244d84b4a859debe523447cccffxb0	http://schema.org/description	"<p>Situated in the Bay of Magalluf in Majorca, Universal Hotel Florida is only 10 minutes from the Palma Nova Beach. The property is close to an active nightlife area, lots of restaurants, and plenty of shops to explore. It's an adults-only establishment near to Katmandu Park.</p>\n\n<p>This property has amenities for all kinds of travelers to enjoy. You can hang out at the outdoor pool that has views of the sea beyond. There's a restaurant with a bar at the hotel. You'll find a meeting room that can be booked for any private gatherings for business dealings. Other features you'll find are an airport shuttle service, a concierge, and a free buffet breakfast every morning.</p>\n\n<p>The 204 rooms at Universal Hotel Florida all have light, airy decor that feels very beach-like. You can book double, triple, or quadruple rooms with or without a view. All rooms have private bathrooms with deep soaking tubs. There are flat-screen TVs with satellite programming and free Wi-Fi for your entertainment needs. You'll have a balcony to relax on, and a refrigerator as an added convenience.</p>\n\n<p>You can book your room at an all-inclusive rate so all your food and beverages are included with your stay. Meals can be found at the in-house buffet restaurant. If you want to venture off the property, you can try Foxy's or Kalodromo, which are just minutes away.</p>\n\n<p>Western Water Park is about a half-hour from Universal Hotel Florida. You can also walk to Golf Fantasia, Playa Son Matias, and Pirates Adventure Show easily from the property. Explore a little further away and you'll find Marineland Mallorca.</p>"
