_:n9a6daf0d890f4835969aa26e0bc0ce92xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Ocho Rios, RIU Ocho Rios All Inclusive is an easy drive from Dunn's River Falls and Saint Ann's Bay. Guests can also enjoy direct access to the exclusive beach.\n\nThis art deco resort provides free Wi-Fi, an outdoor pool and an all-inclusive meal plan. Relaxation facilities include a beauty centre and a sauna. It also offers superb facilities for meetings and events.\n\nRIU Ocho Rios All Inclusive has 856 rooms, all of which are fitted with cable/satellite channels.\n\nThe resort's restaurant is available for breakfast, offering guests an easy dining experience not far from their room. A relaxing beverage can be enjoyed in the on-site bar. A wide selection of dining options are also found in close proximity to the property.\n\nRIU Ocho Rios All Inclusive provides easy access to Saint Ann's Bay Old Jail. It is also a short drive from Runaway Bay and St. Ann's Bay."
