_:nf43821023a074f759bfd9b159f74ed46xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This contemporary Richmond hotel is situated within a 10-minute stroll of Richmond-Brighouse Station. It is located a brief walk from Richmond Centre and Richmond Public Library Brighouse Branch.\n\nGuests can soak up the outdoors on the terrace or have a drink at the bar. It features a Jacuzzi and a free shuttle service, as well as an outdoor pool.\n\nThe rooms are air conditioned and include a refrigerator, tea and coffee making facilities and a spa bath. They all have a radio, wireless internet access and a desk.\n\nSheraton Vancouver Airport provides a conveniently located on-site café. Alternatively, there are a variety of eating options in the surrounding area. There is also the added convenience of an in-house restaurant.\n\nAttractions close to Sheraton Vancouver Airport include Water Sky Garden and Richmond Olympic Oval. Additionally, many tourist attractions are within easy reach."
