_:nd7f4b7cf05cd44f7a0370b6a736fc038xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located in Ubud, The Payogan Villa Resort and Spa is within easy reach of Museum Puri Lukisan and Ubud Monkey Forest. It also provides a free shuttle service, an indoor pool and a rooftop terrace.\n\nA variety of personalized services are available for guests of The Payogan Villa Resort and Spa, like valet parking, a car rental desk and babysitting/child services. Staff are available 24/7 and can book tours and tickets. It also offers convenient facilities for business meetings and events.\n\nThe resort features 27 rooms, each equipped with a mini bar, a refrigerator and wireless internet access. They are also fitted with a hair dryer and a telephone.\n\nWith its own restaurant that serves international dishes, the resort provides guests with all they require for an enjoyable night within the resort."
