_:nc9e5a4dab1f44be185e3be8a71010997xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Set on the dramatic Atlantic coastline in the southernmost region of Portugal, the breathtaking Conrad Algarve hotel is located at Quinta do Lago, one of the world's most alluring destinations, known for its world-class golf courses, stunning beaches and the idyllic scenery of Ria Formosa Natural Park. Only 20 minutes from Faro airport, this luxurious Portuguese resort is home to one of Europe's most decadent Spas, perfect for discerning travelers who want to 'get away from it all'. Our 5-star Conrad Algarve hotel boasts a range of luxurious rooms, all of which offer unparalleled quality in modern design, comfort and technology. All of our accommodations feature a beautiful marble bathroom, balcony and a modern entertainment system. Food lovers at this Algarve resort will be spoiled for choice with the Conrad Algarve hotel's restaurants and bars. Savor the finest selection of Mediterranean products in the hotel's signature restaurant, Gusto by Heinz Beck, or enjoy the seclusion of your own private cabana as you sip cocktails by the sparkling poolside in Dado. Energize in the Fitness Centre, work on your handicap with the resident PGA Golf Pro or improve your serve on the outdoor tennis court. Cool down with a dip in one of the hotel's beautiful outdoor swimming pools and soothe mind and spirit with a relaxing holistic beauty treatment in our luxury Spa."
