_:ne9fcc3f2a9b8455ab4bd3d17beb0459exb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located in the touristic area of Kuta and only just a 10-minute drive to Seminyak Beach, Grand Zuri Kuta Bali offers comfortable accommodation with an outdoor swimming pool, a kids pool and a pool bar. Free WiFi access is available in all areas of the property. It takes about a 15-minute drive from the property to the iconic Kuta Beach, Beachwalk Shopping Centre, and the famous Waterbom Waterpark. Getting to Ngurah Rai International Airport will take about 25 minutes by car. The rooms at Grand Zuri Kuta feature a minimalistic design and fitted with air conditioning, flat-screen satellite TV, a minibar, and an electric kettle. In each room, there is also an en suite bathroom which features shower facilities, slippers, a hairdryer, and free toiletries. Other facilities offered at this property include a free access to the fitness centre, a 24-hour front desk with concierge service, a tour desk to help with travel arrangements, and free luggage storage. Laundry and dry cleaning services, meeting/banquet facilities, airport shuttle, car rental are available with extra charges. Guests can enjoy a variety of treatments at the spa centre and a 24-hour in-room massages can also be requested. As for dining option, the on-site Cerenti Restaurant serves Western and Asian dishes. Guests can also explore the surrounding area where a culinary area is reachable within a 20-minute drive."
