_:n893df7a57b98421d91a67705e66a44c0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated just 7.5 km from Pillnitz Castle and Park, Laurichhof features accommodation in Pirna with access to a garden, a bar, as well as a lift. Free WiFi is offered throughout the property and private parking is available on site. The aparthotel has family rooms as well as facilities for disabled guests. All units in the aparthotel are fitted with air conditioning, a seating area, a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, a kitchen, a dining area, a safety deposit box and a private bathroom with a walk-in shower, a hair dryer and free toiletries. Some units have a terrace and/or a balcony with mountain views and an outdoor dining area. Additional in-room amenities include wine or champagne, fruits and chocolates or cookies. Buffet and à la carte breakfast options with warm dishes, local specialities and fresh pastries are available each morning at the aparthotel. Guests are welcome to eat in the on-site family-friendly restaurant, which is open for dinner, lunch, brunch and cocktails. Guests at Laurichhof will be able to enjoy activities in and around Pirna, like canoeing and hiking. Skiing, cycling and fishing are possible within the area, and the accommodation offers ski storage space. Königstein Fortress is 14 km from Laurichhof, while Panometer Dresden is 21 km from the property. The nearest airport is Dresden, 38 km from the aparthotel, and the property offers a paid airport shuttle service."
