_:nc75724ff7fdd4c57af43202e8aac5a58xb0	http://schema.org/description	"We expect big things from German design and Roomers doesn’t disappoint. Oana Rosen, a leader of Frankfurt’s new wave of repurposing old work spaces into cozy living spaces, has transformed this abandoned office building into a monument of elegant modern hospitality design."
