_:n38bee249038c49f38abca64565e150c0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This is a building whose fame, paradoxically, ends up obscuring it — “Scotland Yard” now refers to wherever the Metropolitan Police headquarters is, and the name followed the agency when it moved, over a century ago, into new digs closer to Westminster. Now Great Scotland Yard, the original Edwardian brick edifice, is back in circulation, this time as a luxury hotel in Hyatt’s Unbound Collection."
_:n38bee249038c49f38abca64565e150c0xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Great Scotland Yard London in London"
