_:n86218c457d4a434eb7ccb1c89b434ca0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Mainz is a city that loves to show off its Rhineside grandeur, particularly (and expectedly) where it touches the old town. Hyatt Regency chose their spot well, in other words, even going so far as to incorporate the charming 19th-century Fort Malakoff into its premises. A set of sunkissed terraces make for relaxed bookends to days spent touring all the patrician jewels along the river. Rooms respect the sense of place with bright, airy layouts and front-row seats to the cityscape in the sunset."
_:n86218c457d4a434eb7ccb1c89b434ca0xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Hyatt Regency Mainz em Mainz"
