_:n6fd18e2b636d45bc848d97ebde257aecxb0	http://schema.org/description	"This 18C guesthouse is invested with plenty of heart and soul – namely that of the Rembold family, which has run this place with great dedication for several decades. It shows in the smart guestrooms with high-quality decor, as well as in the excellent breakfast."
