_:n38e3d934821148cd81cc30adbdcb8db7xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hyatt’s luxury-boutique hotel brand is known for audacious design choices, and the rakishly slanted skyscraper that houses Andaz Capital Gate Abu Dhabi is nothing if not audacious. A lesser hotel might have lost its nerve when the time came to design the interiors, but these spaces are ultra-modern, though not at all without warmth — in fact the rooms are as cozy as a glass-walled skyscraper can be. There’s art everywhere, including a dedicated gallery space, and the 19th-floor pool deck adjoins a generous spa and fitness center. It’s right next door to the Abu Dhabi National Exhibition Centre, and a scant 15 minutes from the airport."
_:n38e3d934821148cd81cc30adbdcb8db7xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Andaz Capital Gate Abu Dhabi in Abu Dhabi"
_:n38e3d934821148cd81cc30adbdcb8db7xb0	http://schema.org/numberOfRooms	"188"
_:n6ce632b9e08e41a2a68be5ba81ccd3aexb0	http://schema.org/availableLanguage	"en-AUT"
_:n6ce632b9e08e41a2a68be5ba81ccd3aexb0	http://schema.org/brand	"Tablet Hotels"
_:n6ce632b9e08e41a2a68be5ba81ccd3aexb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Andaz hotels were among the first incursions by the big hospitality chains into boutique-hotel territory, and they’re the strongest examples of a hotel that offers the best of both worlds: the consistent standards and hard-won expertise of a chain with the stylistic freedom and aesthetic personality of an independent. Andaz Vienna Am Belvedere is the group’s first in Austria, its fourth in Europe, and it’s a surprisingly forward-looking hotel, given its history-laden setting."
_:n6ce632b9e08e41a2a68be5ba81ccd3aexb0	http://schema.org/name	"Andaz Vienna Am Belvedere in Vienna"
_:n6ce632b9e08e41a2a68be5ba81ccd3aexb0	http://schema.org/numberOfRooms	"303"
