_:n3417cddca90e482e89ede71ef00c16d1xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hollywood and Singapore might not be obvious sister cities, but the Mondrian Singapore Duxton’s Art Deco–inspired exterior might look equally at home on Sunset Boulevard. Inside, however, designers Studio Carter have paid plentiful tribute to heritage Singaporean architectural styles, most obviously in the Shophouse Suites, an adaptation of the distinctive local form. The accommodations are stylish and more than a little bit luxurious, while the hotel’s social life is given equal emphasis, if not more — Bottega di Carna is the work of the Italian restaurateur and butcher Dario Cecchini, while the Jungle Ballroom and the rooftop Canyon Club are the hotel’s glamorous nightspots."
