_:nc4c27bd591d14bbf989dbe20c887d2b9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Once upon a time Baden-Baden, the spa town in Germany’s Black Forest, would have been where you’d go for a bit of classic old-world hospitality. The opening of Roomers Baden-Baden, then, came as a bit of a shock — nothing could have prepared the local hotel scene for a brand-new modern building containing a boutique-style luxury hotel by the Milanese designer Piero Lissoni."
