_:n3a64d9b47a9a4ea8842b282b526e1c5dxb92	http://schema.org/description	"Nestled in the city's heart, this luxury Vienna hotel offers unparalleled convenience. Discover DoubleTree by Hilton Vienna Schonbrunn, ideally situated just two kilometers from Wien Westbahnhof train station, four kilometers from the vibrant Innere Stadt, a 10-minute drive from the world's oldest zoo, Schoenbrunn Zoo, and a five-minute stroll away from Schoenbrunn Palace, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. It is connected to the world's renowned Museum of Technology for those with an interest in technology.\r\n\r\nThis 4-star hotel in Vienna has 247 well-appointed rooms, including 24 exquisite suites boasting enchanting views of the castle. The rooms are designed to provide a serene and peaceful atmosphere, featuring a 49-inch flat-screen TV, air-conditioning, a laptop-size safe, a minibar, and a luxurious bathroom.\r\n\r\nDoubleTree by Hilton Vienna Schonbrunn, offers an array of exceptional amenities to enhance your stay. Unwind and rejuvenate at the fitness center, complete with a sauna and steam bath, providing the perfect respite after a day of exploration. This hotel in Vienna provides underground parking, a business center, and complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi.\r\n\r\nPrepare your palate for an extraordinary culinary journey at the esteemed in-house restaurant, Sissi and Joe. Savor a blend of Austrian and International cuisine expertly crafted to delight your senses. Embrace the flavors and culinary finesse infused into every dish by our talented chefs.\r\n\r\nDoubleTree by Hilton Vienna Schonbrunn has 8 meeting rooms, well-equipped to host your next event or conference in style. With a capacity to accommodate up to 500 guests, the hotel's expansive and versatile spaces are ideal for corporate gatherings and social celebrations."
