_:n28e54d640e8c43389acbea8b371450afxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Puri Santrian is a modern Balinese resort strategically positioned on the beach at the tranquil southern end of Sanur. Close to several historic sites of interest, it is an upmarket area with strong cultural roots where tradition permeates all aspects of daily life. Cocooned within a mature tropical garden, the hotel presents a choice of elegant Balinese accommodation options supported by essential lifestyle facilities. Characterised by a design aesthetic that celebrates Bali’s rich artistic heritage, Puri Santrian is respectful of the surrounding environment. The general layout is inspired by an extended royal compound with separate wings featuring different room categories. This community-style concept evokes a real sense of belonging whereby an attentive team is always on hand to provide exceptional service with a warm Balinese smile. As a family owned and operated resort, Puri Santrian remains fully committed to preserving Balinese culture whilst remaining relevant in today’s fast-changing times. This entails maintaining a fine balance between modernisation, authenticity and the spirit of local tradition. Essentially, Puri Santrian delivers genuine hospitality where people are made to feel welcome and every stay promises a memorable experience."
