_:nbc04b59d751246cda035de106024c352xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Bvlgari Resort Bali is an exclusive and intimate setting for guests seeking privacy and luxury. The 59-villa and 5-mansion resort boasts sophisticated facilities, such as the Italian and Indonesian restaurants, the lounge bar, the Spa offering a complete range of Balinese, Asian and European therapies and a cliff-edge pool. A Bvlgari store, a Balinese antiques store as well as conference and wedding facilities complete the resort’s features. The Bvlgari Escape curates life's purest pleasures in one of nature's most beautiful destinations. Designed to inspire, Bvlgari Resort Bali brings Italian glamour close to home, making it a perfect way to escape the ordinary without travelling far. The experience includes breakfast, welcome amenities and a relaxing 60-minute massage. Discover More https://www.bulgarihotels.com/en_US/bali/whats-on/article/bali/at-the-resort/Bvlgari-Escape Location for weddings that is owned by Bvlgari Resort Bali WATER WEDDING The altar at Bulgari Resort Bali is set upon a transparent carpet gently floating on the surface of the Water Pond. A truly unique experience, for a wedding ceremony held in front of the infinity of the Indian Ocean. Certainly an impeccable wedding venue in Bali. THE BULGARI MANSION WEDDING Designed by the Italian architectural firm Antonio Citterio Patricia Viel, the Mansion is inspired by Balinese culture and design. Located within the Resort on a secluded hill bordered by cliffs, the five-bedroom Mansion offers extraordinary views of the Indian Ocean and spacious outdoor and indoor areas that cover 4,415 square metres. The altar is set upon a transparent carpet floating on the surface of the upper pool, creating a truly unique experience. To continue the celebration in privacy and style, the Bulgari Mansion Wedding includes a two-night stay in a five-bedroom Mansion. A Bulgari Wedding Planner will take care of all necessary coordination to ensure an exquisite day. The Wedding Planner orchestrates such details as the arrangement of flowers, music to be played during the vow exchange, and drinks and food for the reception. LA TERRAZZA Nestled in a discreet corner overlooking the Indian Ocean and its magnificent sunsets, La Terrazza offers a sophisticated yet informal outdoor setting that is ideal for all kinds of social gatherings and celebrations. Adjacent to the Pavilion and the Chapel, La Terrazza is accessible by a wooden bridge that leads to a spacious 136-square-metre open-air terrace. It has capacity of up to 12 for a wedding ceremony and up to 30 for dinner, and guests may choose from a selection of Indonesian and Italian menus to help create a personal, memorable occasion. A Bulgari Wedding Planner will take care of all necessary coordination to ensure an exquisite day. The Wedding Planner orchestrates such details as the arrangement of flowers, music to be played during the vow exchange, and drinks and food for the reception. If guests wish, the Wedding Planner can make arrangements to have the ceremony include specific religious rites, and/or civil registration of the marriage under Indonesian law, at an additional cost. They can also help organize pre-wedding aperitivo for guests, the wedding dinner and cake, entertainment, dance performances, and photography/video shooting. THE BULGARI CHAPEL The Bulgari Chapel has come to life as a celebration of tradition and elegance at the Bulgari Resort Bali. Defined by the unmistakable Bulgari mark of style and gracefulness, The Chapel is unveiled to further enhance the Resort’s unique ambience. As the first Bulgari wedding chapel in the world, it has been created from the Paras Kerobokan stone from Bali and hand-crafted floor-to-ceiling glass paneling. Adjacent to the Chapel, the 300 square-metre Pavilion Terrace is the perfect outdoor venue boasting an unrivalled view over the ocean as the background, befitting any occasion. THE BULGARI VILLA The ample and exclusive hospitality and dining facilities of the Bulgari Villa at Bulgari Resort Bali make it the ideal place to organize events and private dinners and private parties in Bali. The lower level of the private garden features a terrace with gazebo for cocktail parties, while the upper level hosts a reflecting pool that creates the perfect atmosphere for a wedding reception. BEACH WEDDING An exclusive experience for those who choose to celebrate their ceremony on a secluded, white sand beach in front of a brilliant blue lagoon with wild Indian Ocean crashing on the reef. An unforgettable beach wedding at Bulgari Resort Bali. Check Availability &amp; Best Prices"
