_:nb99eb9ba2bfc43f3ac27b61dbd0e0b87xb0	http://schema.org/description	"A stay at Hilton Vienna Plaza places you in the heart of Vienna, within a 15-minute walk of Danube River and Vienna Christmas Market. This family-friendly hotel is 0. 6 mi (1 km) from Hofburg Imperial Palace and 0. 7 mi (1. 1 km) from Spanish Riding School. . Don't miss out on the many recreational opportunities, including a sauna, a 24-hour fitness center, and bicycles to rent. This Art Deco hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and babysitting (surcharge). . Make yourself at home in one of the 254 guestrooms. Complimentary wireless internet access is available to keep you connected. Private bathrooms have complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as laptop-compatible safes and desks. . Satisfy your appetite for lunch or dinner at the hotel's restaurant, ÉMILE Restaurant, or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily for a fee. . Featured amenities include a business center, express check-out, and complimentary newspapers in the lobby. This hotel has 9 meeting rooms available for events. Self parking (subject to charges) is available onsite. . Distances are displayed to the nearest 0. 1 mile and kilometer. University of Vienna - 0. 4 km / 0. 2 mi- Votive Church - 0. 5 km / 0. 3 mi- Sigmund Freud Museum - 0. 6 km / 0. 4 mi- Burgtheater - 0. 7 km / 0. 4 mi- Danube River - 0. 7 km / 0. 4 mi- Rathausplatz - 0. 7 km / 0. 4 mi- Rathaus - 0. 8 km / 0. 5 mi- Graben - 0. 8 km / 0. 5 mi- Vienna Christmas Market - 0. 8 km / 0. 5 mi- St. Peter's Church - 0. 9 km / 0. 6 mi- Fleischmarkt - 1 km / 0. 6 mi- Hofburg Imperial Palace - 1 km / 0. 6 mi- Plague Column - 1 km / 0. 6 mi- Austrian Parliament Building - 1 km / 0. 6 mi- Sissi Museum - 1. 1 km / 0. 7 mi. The preferred airport for Hilton Vienna Plaza is Vienna International Airport (VIE) - 19. 7 km / 12. 2 mi .\n- Distance To Airport: 19km to VIE\r\n"
_:nb99eb9ba2bfc43f3ac27b61dbd0e0b87xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Hilton Vienna Plaza, Austria, Vienna, Vienna | Thomas Cook"
_:n3db2e9ae13cc4b2695cc225390241b3exb0	http://schema.org/description	"A hotel only for adults Ibiza Port, Figueretes Beach, and Marina Botafoch are popular spots near The Standard, Ibiza. The closest airport is Ibiza Airport, which is six miles from the hotel.\r\nOverview\r\nThe Standard takes its place in a long line of bold characters to make its mark on Ibiza. Fifty-three rooms and suites occupy the streamlined, white hotel a pebble's throw from the marina. Down the block, Casa Privada serves the pleasures of a stylish private residence.  \r\nCasa Privada\r\nThere's visiting Ibiza, and then there's making yourself at home in Ibiza. That's Casa Privada.\r\nLet's start with the basics: Casa Privada is a villa steps from The Standard, Ibiza. It's got 14 guest rooms and suites, a shady courtyard, private indoor lounge, yoga room and two private rooftop pools with spectacular Old Town views. Guests in Casa Privada also enjoy access to all the amenities and guest spaces at The Standard, Ibiza.\r\nCulinary\r\nThe hotel's ground-floor entrance and street-level restaurant Jara throw open the doors to beautiful strangers and the buzzing street scene, while guests enjoy farm-to-table cuisine and fresh cocktails, café-style. On the menu are dishes that allow ingredients to do the talking: vine-ripened tomato tartare expresses the agrarian staple at its finest. Sea bass “divorciado” and other fruits de la mer celebrate Ibiza's rich port history. In the evening, Jara is a social and culinary destination, upping the ante within intimate banquettes and closed curtains, creating an atmosphere where anything goes.\r\nUP is pure, dreamy Ibiza. Our seasonal rooftop bar and restaurant surrounds guests with Old Town's most picturesque views. Savor elevated Japanese-Mexican flavors and sip exquisite cocktails, poolside. UP is Isla Blanca as you imagined it, and more.\r\n \r\nFacilities and services include 24-hour reception, air conditioning, a bar, car parking (extra charge), concierge facilities, a bar, free Wi-Fi, gym and fitness facilities, a pool, a restaurant, spa facilities (extra charge), and a safe.\r\n\r\nRooms feature air conditioning, a balcony or terrace, a hairdryer, a minibar or fridge, a safe in the room, a television, and a telephone.\r\n\r\nAddress: Carrer de Bartomeu Vicent Ramon, 9, 07800 Ibiza, Spain"
_:n3db2e9ae13cc4b2695cc225390241b3exb0	http://schema.org/name	"The Standard Ibiza, Balearic Islands, Ibiza, Es Canar | Thomas Cook"
_:n3db2e9ae13cc4b2695cc225390241b3exb0	http://schema.org/priceRange	"from £770.55 per person"
_:n06125d67ad6c400596a664541c670fecxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Seaclub Alcudia Mediterranean Resort, located in the bay of Alcúdia, is a complex formed by Mediterranean-style villas surrounded by extensive areas of gardens. Enjoy a perfect holiday, whether you are looking for an unforgettable family experience with activities and facilities designed for the enjoyment of the little ones. Live your best holidays in our hotel in Alcúdia. Situated in Alcudia Port, it is 500 m from the beach, 1 km from a water park, 2.5 km from the marina, and 60 km from Palma de Mallorca Airport.\r\nFacilities and services include restaurant, bar, mini club, swimming pool, children's pool, gym, massages (extra charge), laundry service (extra charge), parking, wireless Internet access and 24-hour reception.\r\n\r\nStudios feature living room, kitchen, wireless Internet access, air conditioning, TV, telephone, safe, microwave, coffee/tea maker, heating, hairdryer and balcony/terrace.\r\n\r\nPremium Apartment also feature two sofa beds for extra person.\r\n\r\nPlease note that some of the above facilities may be closed due to weather / seasonal conditions.\r\n\r\nCleaning 3 days/week, change of towels 2 days/week, bed sheets 1 day/week.\r\n\r\nPlease note there is some deposit to get paid on spot.\r\n\r\nIn case of choosing the option of all inclusive:\r\nThe All Inclusive-concept includes all meals (breakfast, lunch, dinner and snacks) and mealtime drinks such as soft drinks, beer, wine, water and alcoholic drinks, all of local brands. \r\nDrinks are served from morning until late evening (approx until 22.-24.00 hrs). \r\nOpening times vary between different hotels. \r\nIn certain hotels the activities program is also included.\r\n\r\nPlease note that from April 1 the main reception will be at Avenida de Mexico.\r\n\r\nAddress: Avda. de Mexico s/n, 07410 Puerto de Alcudia, Mallorca, Spain."
_:n06125d67ad6c400596a664541c670fecxb0	http://schema.org/name	"Seaclub Alcudia Mediterranean Resort, Balearic Islands, Majorca, Alcudia Bay | Thomas Cook"
_:n06125d67ad6c400596a664541c670fecxb0	http://schema.org/priceRange	"from £319.26 per person"
_:na9b07d7699294e7da084405f9ac6e086xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Reverence Life Hotel, 4**** (Adults Only) is located on the southwest coast of Mallorca just a few meters from the magnificent Playa de Santa Ponça. It is ideal for adults who wish to enjoy new and pleasant experiences of relax, gastronomy, wellness and/or sports. \n \nReverence Life Hotel, 4**** (Adults Only)l feature four buildings distributed as follows:\n \n- Life Building: It is located the hotel reception, Bar lounge, as well as a restaurant for breakfast and dinner and a meeting room. \n \n- Sky Building: It has a rooftop terrace with a pool for all guests of the hotel, multipurpose room, conference room, pa and a restaurant for breakfast. \n \n- Sunrise Building: Premium rooms overlooking the pool are located in this building and also a gym, Spa and a conference room. It also offers the clients of the rooms accommodated in this building a rooftop swimming pool for exclusive use. \n \n- Sunset Building: This building allocated the Premium rooms with lateral sea view, the parking, the bike station and also offers our clients staying in rooms lodged in this building with a rooftop swimming pool for exclusive use. \n \nEnjoy its eight pools, six of them are outdoor, three of them have a swim up area, and one of them is semi-Olympic size. Two swimming pools located on the roofs of the Sunset and Sunrise buildings, exclusive for our guests staying in Premium rooms and enjoying wide panoramic views of the surroundings areas(sea, pine forests and mountains). A swimming pool on the top floor of the Sky building with panoramic views and free access for all our customers. Finally, two indoor swimming pools in the Reverence Wellness & SPA. \n \nReverence Life Hotel, 4**** (Adults Only) has a varied offer of rooms, most of them with views to the swimming pools or to the Santa Ponsa bay. It also has two suites and two Junior Suites with private terraces located on the highest floors of the Life and Sky buildings.\n- Distance To Airport: 25km to PMI\r\n"
_:na9b07d7699294e7da084405f9ac6e086xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Reverence Life Hotel, Balearic Islands, Majorca, Santa Ponsa | Thomas Cook"
_:na9b07d7699294e7da084405f9ac6e086xb0	http://schema.org/priceRange	"from £428.06 per person"
_:n6d7d646c16b648bd855d65a2f33078a5xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The SBH MONICA BEACH RESORT hotel,  renovated in 2015, is located on the first line of the extensive Costa Calma beach. Its unbeatable location provides the relaxation and beauty that guarantee unique sunrises and sunsets. Its spacious and modern rooms perfectly equipped, as well as a complete range of sports and leisure activities, will make your stay at the Hotel MONICA BEACH RESORT, the ideal place to enjoy your holidays.\n\nThe SBH MONICA BEACH RESORT hotel has 409 rooms distributed between Double Standard, Double Sea View, Suites and Apartments perfectly equipped.\n\nAll rooms have a private balcony or terrace, TV, telephone, satellite channels, safe (with charge), desk, fan and air conditioning, bathroom with bath, hair dryer, free toiletries.\n\nBaby cot available on request. The rooms of the SBH Monica Beach Resort invites you to enjoy a few days of authentic pleasure and relaxation with the best services.\n\nThe gastronomy of this all-inclusive hotel is rich and varied. You will be able to taste the exquisite international and Canarian cuisine in its main restaurant or taste sophisticated dishes of Asian food in its thematic restaurant. The hotel's main restaurant offers a great variety of specialties in appetizers, main dishes, salads and desserts. This restaurant offers assorted breakfasts ranging from smoothies, crepes, fruit to bacon, eggs, etc. . Lunch and dinner are provided with fish and meat grill cooked live. Up to 5 bars (2 next to the swimming pools), complement the varied offer that you will be able to enjoy in this hotel.\n\nThe hotel has 4 swimming pools, 3 swimming pools for adults, one of which is heated in winter, and a children's pool, all equipped with sun beds and umbrellas."
_:n6d7d646c16b648bd855d65a2f33078a5xb0	http://schema.org/name	"SBH Monica Beach, Canary Islands, Fuerteventura, Costa Calma | Thomas Cook"
_:n6d7d646c16b648bd855d65a2f33078a5xb0	http://schema.org/priceRange	"from £472.64 per person"
_:n2d24f13e026b4beeb1223809060f8802xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The hotel SBH CLUB PARAISO PLAYA, is a 4**** hotel located in front of the beach of Esquinzo. Its unbeatable location provides relaxation and beauty that guarantee unforgettable sunrises and sunsets, unique in this area of the island. Its spacious and modern rooms perfectly equipped, as well as a complete range of sports and leisure activities, will make your stay at the Hotel CLUB PARAISO PLAYA, the ideal place to enjoy your holidays.\nThe SBH CLUB PARAISO PLAYA hotel has 317 rooms, perfectly equipped to offer maximum comfort to all guests. It has three types of rooms, Standard Double, Double Sea View and Family Rooms with separate bedroom and a living room with sofa bed. All rooms have a private balcony or terrace, TV, telephone, satellite channels, safe, desk, fan and air conditioning, bathroom with bath, hair dryer, free toiletries.\n\nBaby cot available on request.\n- Distance To Airport: 75km to FUE\r\n"
_:n2d24f13e026b4beeb1223809060f8802xb0	http://schema.org/name	"SBH Club Paraiso Playa, Canary Islands, Fuerteventura, Jandia | Thomas Cook"
_:n2d24f13e026b4beeb1223809060f8802xb0	http://schema.org/priceRange	"from £415.22 per person"
_:n3c209e0b0f60440eaa046a4426ec2819xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This hotel is located at the heart of Playa del Ingles. This wonderful, exclusive hotel enjoys direct access to the Yumbo Centre, and lies just 900 metres away from the beach and about 20 minutes from the airport. It is within easy access of a host of attractions, making the property the ideal choice for the ones seeking for exploration or relaxation. This charming accommodation comprises classically designed rooms, which offer an atmosphere of peace. They are well equipped with modern conveniences such as AC, satellite TV and bathroom with hair dryer added for guests' comfort. Guests are sure to be impressed by the broad range of facilities and services including an outdoor pool and wellness centre and are assured of a comfortable stay. The accommodation is not recommended for clients with reduced mobility, due to lots of stairs within the accommodation.\n- Distance To Airport: 30km to LPA\r\n"
