_:nb28a769a7d9747f88cf812cd4503e958xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Dive in the blue waters of the Red Sea with our onsite diving center, or play with your family & friends and choose from many exciting water sports. If you wish to keep your fitness high while on vacation, verve to our 24/7 accessible gym or play tennis* or squash*. Our little guests will have fun playing with animation by the beach playground. They can enjoy the kids' club during the day and the kids disco in the evening.\n\nDine-within Pebbles main restaurant for plenty of international, local and Mediterranean dishes during breakfast, lunch & dinner. If you wish to relish and experience a personalized top notch service, don't miss out trying one of our a la carte restaurants (Italian & Seafood). Rotate around one of seven indoor & outdoor bars. \n\nIf you choose to stay in and relax in your bed to watch the satellite LCD TV; our in-room dining menu is there available at your service. \n\nBasic WiFi is available for free within Lobby only. Daily entertainment program is scheduled with various shows throughout the week.\n- Distance To Airport: 8km to HRG\r\n"
