ing size bed, balcony or terrace, kettle (for free), minibar (for a fee), internet (for a fee), safe (for free) and sat TV as well as individually adjustable air conditioning.\r\n\r\n\rBathroom with shower (room size: 41 m&sup2;). Twin Deluxe Room (SeaView): With queen size bed or king size bed, balcony or terrace, kettle (for free), minibar (for a fee), internet (for a fee), safe (for free) and sat TV as well as individually adjustable air conditioning. Bathroom with shower (room size: 41 m&sup2;). 2 Bedroom Suite (SeaView): With queen size bed or king size bed, balcony or terrace, kettle (for free), minibar (for a fee), internet (for a fee), safe (for free) and sat TV as well as individually adjustable air conditioning. Bathroom with shower (room size: 41 m&sup2;). Signature Suite (SeaView): With queen size bed or king size bed, balcony or terrace, kettle (for free), minibar (for a fee), internet (for a fee), safe (for free) and sat TV as well as individually adjustable air conditioning. Bathroom with shower (room size: 41 m&sup2;)."
