_:n51dee76a55884a6e869881befbc430b4xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Boasting a wonderful location in the heart of Sinai Peninsula in the Montazah- Ras Nasrany bay, along the shores of the Red Sea, this outstanding property offers the perfect place to make travellers feel welcome in paradise. Its beachfront location facing Tiran Island, and close to the world renowned snorkelling areas full of coral reefs make this hotel the best choice for nature enthusiasts and beach lovers alike. International Sharm El Sheikh Airport is just 7 kilometres away while Hadaba area and all its shopping and entertainment venues is only a 27-minute drive away. Designed with guests' comfort in mind, a wide choice of different accommodation options is offered to suit all travellers' needs. They all boast a private balcony or terrace with sea, garden or pool views offering personalized services and exclusive facilities. Guests will also appreciate the extensive choice of restaurants serving the finest local and international specialities.\n- Distance To Airport: 7km to SSH\r\n"
