_:n9fd5424450bc4a949eef22cb8ad21b44xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Highlights: \n• Beachfront Resort with Private Sandy Beach \n• One of the Best Coral Reefs at Ras Nasrani \n• Large variety of À la Carte Restaurants \n• Deluxe Jacuzzi Suites\n• Family Friendly Rooms \n\nDiscover magnificence along the shore of the world-famous diving spot, Ras Nasrani's, overlooking Tiran Island and enjoy the crystal-clear sight of the shallow coral reefs and marine fauna alongside the warm family ambience. The resort offers the ideal stay for families and friends with various daily activities, Kids Club and extensive hustle-free area to unwind. Swim your morning away at your choice of any of the 5 pools including one for Kids and spend your afternoon rejuvenating at our Spa or working out at out fully-equipped gym, all while enjoying the mesmerizing ambience at the resort.  The Resort is located 20km from Neama Bay City Centre and 7km from Sharm El Sheikh International Airport."
