_:ne73520a4bb424f8185834d8c865d6951xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This centrally located 4-star hotel is close to Berlin’s main shopping district, the zoo and the Kaiser Wilhelm Memorial Church. Being just a short walk from U-Bahn stations, serving four different underground lines, it is possible to catch direct services to sites such as the Checkpoint Charlie Museum, East Side Gallery and the Holocaust Memorial. The Zoological Gardens station is a mainline station, from where it is possible to catch a train to the attractive city of Potsdam, just 16 miles from Berlin, the former residence of Prussian Kings and the German Kaiser.\r\n\r\nHotel Riu Plaza Berlin has more than 300 rooms with satellite TV, multimedia connections, wifi, air conditioning, mini fridge and coffee making facilities. If you’re going to spend quite a bit of time at the hotel, why not upgrade to a suite to benefit from separate living and sleeping areas. At the fully-equipped gym you will have everything you need to get in a great workout.\r\n\r\nThe hotel offers a breakfast buffet and a la carte main meals in their restaurant, in addition to refreshments and snacks in the hotel's cocktail lounge. You can also take advantage of the Grab & Go service, allowing you to get food to take with you any time of day."
