_:n76957961c3ac4a36800e9db381fe6209xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Chania Flair Boutique Hotel Tapestry Collection by Hilton offers an ideal location in the city of Chania. This adults only hotel (+16) is located alongside the harbour of Nea Chora and the sandy beach of the Venetian-style port city in western Crete. The closest airport is Chania International Airport Daskalogiannis which is 15 km from the accomodation.\r\nFacilities and services include 24-hour air conditioning, WiFi, gym and relaxing pool-jacuzzi, 24-hour reception, restaurant, bar, elevator and room service, and spa (massage on request).\r\n\r\nRooms feature 24-hour air conditioning, WiFi, safe, TV, balcony, fridge, coffee/tea maker, hairdryer, and telephone. \r\n\r\nAddress: Petrof 61, 73131 Chania, Greece."
