_:n6ff2243725fd472f85f811a7194f03a0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Freshly opened at the beautiful village of Oia, the all-suite Andronis Arcadia is as private as you wish and as close to the island cosmopolitan buzz as you 'd like!\r\nEvery single of the 52 luxury suites at Andronis Arcadia has unobstructed sunset views , as also have the fantastic infinity pool and the restaurant. These stunning suites are furnished with the latest and greatest fittings in interior design as well as private pools and floor-to-ceiling windows. These are also  the charming villa options , starting from two up to six bedroom options. \r\nOne of the best Spas on the island, Evexia Spa, curates the very best treatments from all over the world to an atmospheric space that will unlock your body . Hotel's refined dining options, PacMan Restaurant and Opson are ideal  either for a light lunch in the summer sun or for sophisticated dinner under the  stars."
