_:n8bb6a0ee957a4756941f25582fcc5679xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Set on the northern tip of the Arabian Peninsula of the most pristine of the Emirates, Ras Al Khaimah, the Hilton Ras Al Khaimah Beach Resort is a 5* resort offering the perfect destination for a family getaway. Sprawled over 1.5km of private white sandy beach, this award winning resort offers the best in facilities and services. Unwind under a parasol at the beach, work out in the fitness center or enjoy a game of volleyball at the beach club. The resort also has a 200-sqm kids' club with swimming pool and slide, as well as 2000 sq. meter spa with nine treatment rooms. Visit the water sports center for activities such as sailing or waterskiing or relax with a dip in one of seven swimming pools. The Hilton Ras Al Khaimah Beach Resort is a culinary destination resort, where guests can choose from a range of inviting onsite restaurants, from Latin Caribbean, to beachside fare, Mediterranean specialties or Italian fine dining classics. The extensive range of dining options at this Ras Al Khaimah resort present a choice for every occasion. Some restaurants, including the all-day buffet at the Kitchen restaurant, offer a kids menu and a special children's buffet. Hilton Ras Al Khaimah Beach Resort features each of our guest rooms and villa suites at Hilton Ras Al Khaimah Beach Resort's 471 spacious and comfortable rooms, suites and villas feature a balcony or patio, to admire the dazzling sunsets and Arabian Sea. Some rooms offer direct access to the beach with their own garden area where kids can enjoy playing. They also include high-speed internet access, mini bar, and LCD TV among others.\r\n\r\nIts ancient history at the RAK Museum. Let the concierge arrange a trip inland to see the desert, go on a mountain safari, or sail in a traditional dhow in the beautiful Musandam Fjords. All food and beverage outlets will operate as normal during Ramadan except Al Maeda (Lebanese restaurant) and Dome Lounge (lobby lounge). Discover popular attractions and activities surrounding the hotel - in addition to the many on offer in the resort itself. Enjoy horse riding or quad biking nearby, or play a round of golf at one of the area's 18-hole championship golf courses. Explore the city's souks and shopping malls, a short drive from the resort. \r\n\r\n\r\nAll-Inclusive benefits are available from 10 am (except The Kitchen 11am onwards) to midnight. For guests arriving earlier, the meal plan starts with lunch.\r\nAll-Inclusive package ends at 3pm on the day of your departure.\r\nPlease ensure you wear your All-Inclusive wristband to enjoy the following privileges:\r\n\r\nFOOD\r\nIn All-Inclusive Package, meals are served in The Kitchen Restaurant, which is located on the 1st floor.\r\nBreakfast- Weekdays- 06:30–10:30/ Weekends- 06:30- 11:00\r\nLunch- Weekdays 12:30–14:30/ Weekends 13:00- 15:00\r\nDinner- Daily- 18:30–22:30\r\n\r\nPlease note that the all-inclusive package includes 3 main meals a day at The Kitchen restaurant. Starting either from lunch on the day of arrival and ending with breakfast on the day of departure or starting with dinner on the day of arrival and ending with lunch on the day of departure.\r\n\r\nReceive a credit of AED 70 per person (children aged 6–12 years old will receive a credit of AED 35 per person) when you lunch or dine in any of the restaurants and bars below.\r\nA charge will apply for any amount above the credit value.\r\nPiaceri Da Gustare Open for lunch: 12:30 –14:30 (only Saturday and Sunday) and dinner: 19:00–23:00 closed on Mondays\r\nAl-Maeda Open for dinner: 19:00 – 23:00 closed on Tuesdays\r\nVida Churrascaria Open for dinner: 19:00- 23:00 Closed on Wednesdays\r\nArriba 17:00- Midnight\r\nSOL Bar Open 11:00 – 23:00 / Food service 21:00 / Food Service on Sundays until 18:00\r\nSand bar Open 10:00 – 20:00\r\nX.O. Bar Open 18:00 – 02:00\r\nCider Bay Open 10:00 – 19:00\r\nDome Lounge Open 09:00–midnight\r\n\r\nALL INCLUSIVE BEVERAGE ME