nal from 1st of October onwards.&lt;br&gt;No name changes will be accepted, any name change to an existing booking will result in a change of rate to the one available at the time of the amendment.&lt;br&gt;Guest Room Queen: with two queen beds with a beautiful garden from the terrace on the ground floor or the beautiful city side from the balcony on an upper floor.&lt;br&gt;Deluxe Room Sea View Queen: with two queen beds with views overlooking the Sea, located in the main building of the hotel.&lt;br&gt;Deluxe Pool View Villa: with spacious and offer two queen beds. The upper floor rooms benefit from a private balcony overlooking the pool, and the ground floor rooms have direct access to the pool via their private terrace. &#x0D;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deluxe Sea Front Villa (Upper Floor): has a stunning views of the Arabian Gulf from the balcony, located in a newly refurbished Sea front villa which showcases the essence of sophistication and is furnished with two queen beds. &#x0D;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deluxe Beach Access Villa (Ground Floor) has a the stunning views of the Arabian Gulf from the terrace, located in a beach villa of the resort, these modern rooms are the epitome of sophistication and furnished with two queen beds. &#x0D;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Junior Suite Sea Front Villa (Upper Floor) and Junior Suite Beach Access Villa (Lower Floor): located in a villa of the resort, these modern suites are perfect for a long holiday retreat. &#x0D;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tourist fees applicable should be paid upon arrival. &#x0D;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Children share existing bedding – If you require an extra bed, this is subject to availability and additional charges will apply, please contact Operations Team for assistance. Rates are not valid for UAE residents, in case of violations, Bar rate must be paid by the guest directly to the Hotel at the time of check-in. &#x0D;&lt;br&gt;"
