_:n2ead4f5250e147a58e59e5baf34a99f3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hiltons Commitment to You During COVID-19  ” Weve updated our reservation and cancellation policies, extended Hilton Honors Points and status and may be requiring face coverings, temperature checks, health declarations and use of mobile contact tracing at our hotels around the world.  Please visit our  dedicated COVID-19 page  for the latest and before traveling.Set on the dramatic Atlantic coastline in the southernmost region of Portugal, the breathtaking Conrad Algarve hotel is located at Quinta do Lago, one of the world's most alluring destinations, known for its world-class golf courses, stunning beaches and the idyllic scenery of Ria Formosa Natural Park. Only 20 minutes from Faro airport, this luxurious Portuguese resort is home to one of Europe's most decadent Spas, perfect for discerning travelers who want to 'get away from it all'. Our 5-star Conrad Algarve hotel boasts a range of luxurious rooms and private residences, all of which offer unparalleled quality in modern design, comfort and technology. All of our accommodations feature a beautiful marble bathroom, balcony and a modern entertainment system and our spacious private residences also benefit from spacious living and dining areas and a luxurious whirlpool tub. \nFood lovers at this Algarve resort will be spoiled for choice with the Conrad Algarve hotel's restaurants and bars. Savor the finest selection of grilled-to-order meat and fresh seafood in the hotel's signature restaurant, Gusto, or enjoy the seclusion of your own private cabana as you sip cocktails by the sparkling poolside in Dado. Energize in the Fitness Center, work on your handicap in the golf simulation area or improve your serve on the outdoor tennis court. Cool down with a dip in one of the hotel's beautiful outdoor swimming pool and soothe mind and spirit with a relaxing holistic beauty treatment in our luxury Spa."
