_:n12c3e0fd3f0b445bb4704798bf3e6497xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The hotel is positioned at the start of the causeway leading to the Pearl-Qatar project. It is minutes away from the city's financial and commercial centre and places of cultural and historical interest. The property is situated only 20 kms from Doha International Airport. The rooms are decorated with contemporary Arabian touches that are complemented by a work desk and a marble en suite bathroom with walk-in rainfall shower and separate tub. The hotel provides a 400-metre luxury private beach, outdoor swimming pool and fully equipped gym. Guests can entice their senses at the Rocca poolside restaurant overlooking landscaped gardens and the west bay lagoon. Diverse cuisine of the Mediterranean and authentic fare from France, Greece, Italy, Morocco, Spain and Turkey is prepared in a lively open kitchen and wood-fired oven. The hotel is the perfect location for unforgettable memories.\n- Distance To Airport: 24km to DOH\r\n"
