_:n0b122e7338944340968efb20444f2e65xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The barrier-free H+ Hotel Leipzig-Halle is conveniently located near the A14 motorway and is ideally situated for visiting Halle an der Saale which is steeped in tradition and the music city of Leipzig. Thanks to its favourable connection to the exhibition grounds, the hotel is perfectly suitable for exhibition guests or those attending a business meeting in Halle or Leipzig. There are 301 rooms available for your accommodation with a choice of \"Comfort\" and \"Business” categories as well as family rooms. Each one features a desk, a mini bar, satellite and TV. The Wi-Fi connection is inclusive.\r\n\r\nConvenient location close to the Halle/Peißen motorway exit\r\nRooms with Wi-Fi and TV, extra beds available\r\nBreakfast buffet and restaurant, hotel shop\r\n190 free parking spaces\r\n13 meeting rooms equipped with modern technology\r\n\r\nAs a guest of the H+ Hotel Leipzig-Halle you are invited to enjoy the extensive breakfast buffets in the morning for a great start to an action-packed day. The restaurant offers regional and international cuisine and provides à la carte delicacies for your lunch and dinner. Anyone who has forgotten or is looking for something to snack on, can find a selection of beverages, snacks, newspapers, toiletries and ice cream in the hotel shop which is open around the clock.\r\nFurthermore, the 13 multi-functional meeting rooms are suitable for meetings, seminars or other events.\r\nHave a comfortable and conveniently located stay at the H+ Hotel Leipzig-Halle. This way, you have the opportunity to discover two attractive towns at once!"
