_:node1iff48kicx5211312	https://schema.org/name	"Mercure Kuta Bali"
_:node1iff48kicx5211312	https://schema.org/description	""
_:node1iff48kicx5211312	https://schema.org/reviewBody	"It’s all about the location at Mercure Hotel Kuta Beach. This nice chain hotel is located right in front of one of the most famous beaches in Bali—the hot favourite with the surfing community. It is on one of main streets of Kuta that is all packed with restaurants and shopping opportunities. The rooms aren’t too big, but they are comfortable and have all the amenities. There is a great infinity pool with a beautiful view over the beach at the top floor, and a bar that serves delicious drinks. Breakfast is incredibly varied, with fresh bakery products, fresh fruits, continental and American style breakfast and even more local food. There is a lovely patio and reception area. The staff is incredibly kind, available round the clock, and polite, helping guest with transportation and further travel arrangements.\n\n\n "
_:node1iff48kicx5211312	https://schema.org/url	"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/travel/bali/mercure-kuta-bali/ps53871980.cms"
_:node1ifdn1qsmx5067690	https://schema.org/name	"Hilton Garden Inn Dubai"
_:node1ifdn1qsmx5067690	https://schema.org/name	"Times of India"
_:node1ifdn1qsmx5067690	https://schema.org/description	""
_:node1ifdn1qsmx5067690	https://schema.org/reviewBody	" If you are in Dubai for some business purpose, Hilton Garden Inn Dubai can be your preferred choice as all the major business hubs are within 10 min reach. Not to worry if you are in the city for a vacation; this hotel has easy access to some of the major attractions too. Situated in the Port Rashid district of Dubai, you can easily hop into the Dubai Mall, which is 10 min away from the hotel, and shop till you drop. Jumeirah beaches can also be added into your wish list in case you want to beat the heat in style and capture some great shots in your camera to make your friends back home envy you. The hotel has an on-site Garden Grille & Bar to give respite to your hunger pangs. Serving mouth-watering local and international dishes, you just don’t have to worry once you set foot on this property. All your needs are catered here and that too at a very reasonable price.\n "
_:node1ifdn1qsmx5067690	https://schema.org/url	"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/travel/dubai/hilton-garden-inn-dubai/ps59806524.cms"
