_:node1ifdjcd8ax7403118	https://schema.org/name	"Hilton Pattaya"
_:node1ifdjcd8ax7403118	https://schema.org/description	""
_:node1ifdjcd8ax7403118	https://schema.org/reviewBody	" When it comes to excellent hotels and luxurious stays, Hilton is not an unfamiliar name. Described by visitors as the place where you will have the best hoteling experience, Hilton has been receiving many good reviews. The hotel is located above the Central Festival Pattaya beach complex and offers spectacular views of the beach and ocean. The beach is right across the street. The complex has more than 300 shops, making it one of the grandest places where you can shop and have a good time in Pattaya. Once in the hotel, you can stroll away to do some exhilarating activities like snorkeling, swimming, and jet skiing on the Coral Island which is off the coast of Pattaya. If you are a boat lover, hop on in for a boat trip and cruise through the Pattaya Floating Market in the neighborhood. For the families, the place can be a wonderful beach getaway. The hotel also offers babysitting service and children’s activities so parents need not be worried much during their stay at the hotel. The hotel boasts of three restaurants where you can enjoy delicious food in excellent ambience. Got a thing for sunsets? Then head for Horizon, the rooftop restaurant on the 34th floor and enjoy a romantic evening. The hotel has a fitness room and a pool to take care of your recreation activities. If you wish to golf, you can visit any of the various golf clubs sprawled across the town. \n "
_:node1ifdjcd8ax7403118	https://schema.org/url	"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/travel/pattaya/hilton-pattaya/ps51438241.cms"
