_:n021538e8c2804e758205e1422d3de2fexb0	http://schema.org/description	"Surrounded by fields and forest, this plush resort is 7 km from the Ubud Monkey Forest, 3 km from the iconic Ubud Palace and 4 km from the Agung Rai Museum of Art.\r\n\r\nFeaturing field and forest views, the sophisticated suites and villas come with free Wi-Fi and flat-screen TVs, as well as living areas, coffeemakers and minibars. They also have terraces, plus private indoor or outdoor heated plunge pools. Room service is offered 24/7.\r\n\r\nAn area shuttle is complimentary. There's a posh restaurant, a bar and a lavish spa, in addition to a hilltop infinity pool with a swim-up bar. Other amenities include a fitness center, a library and a helipad (fee)."
