_:n305aa3279ddd4927aef834c89757edffxb0	http://schema.org/description	"LocationThe resort is located in the village of Pemuteran, on the North West coast of Bali. Singaraja city centre is approximately 45 minutes’ drive away, and the nearest tourist centre is in Lovina, which is 30 minutes away by car. The Pulaki Temple is reached by a short 5-minute drive. Bali International Airport is 120 km and approximately a 3-hour drive away from the resort.FacilitiesGuests have a choice of 2007 rooms. The 24-hour reception desk makes arrival and departure effortless. Amenities include a safe and a currency exchange service. Wireless internet access (for a fee) allows guests to stay connected while on holiday. A variety of shops are available, including a souvenir shop. A garden provides extra space for rest and relaxation in the open air. Additional amenities include a TV room and a library. Guests arriving by car can park their vehicles in the car park. Further services and facilities include a babysitting service, medical assistance, room service (for a fee), a laundry service, a hairdresser and a hotel doctor. Active guests who wish to explore the surrounding area by bike will appreciate the bicycle hire service (for a fee). Bicycle storage is also available.RoomsRooms feature a living area, a kitchen and a bathroom. Air conditioning and a fan ensure comfortable temperatures. Guests can enjoy the sea view from a balcony or terrace. Rooms have a double bed, a queen-size bed or a king-size bed. Separate bedrooms are available. Children's beds and extra beds can be requested for younger guests. A safe, a minibar and a desk are also available. For guests' convenience, units include a refrigerator, a mini fridge, a stovetop and a tea/coffee station. A direct dial telephone, a TV, a radio, a stereo system, a CD player and WiFi (no extra charge) provide all the essentials for a comfortable holiday. Slippers are included. Bathrooms are equipped with a shower, a bathtub and a bidet. A hairdryer, a vanity mirror and bathrobes are available for daily use. Family rooms are available for parents with children.Sports/EntertainmentThe outdoor pool complex includes a children's swimming area and is ideal for working out or just relaxing. A sun terrace, sun loungers, and parasols are available. The hotel offers an extensive outdoor sports programme, including cycling/mountain biking, tennis, bocce, beach volleyball, crazy golf, golf, fishing and horse riding. A wide range of sports are available, including water sports such as canoeing, kayaking, snorkelling and diving or, for a fee, sailing. The hotel offers numerous indoor sports, including table tennis, badminton, darts, yoga, callisthenics and aerobics or, for a fee, a gym. A spa, a sauna, a steam bath, a beauty salon and a solarium are included among the wellness options. For an additional fee, massage treatments are also available. MealsThe dining area includes a restaurant and a bar. Catering options include bed and breakfast, half board and full board. A delicious breakfast gives guests plenty of energy for the day. At lunch and dinner, guests serve themselves at the generous buffet. Gluten-free meals and vegetarian dishes can be prepared on request. The show cooking is a particularly special attraction. The hotel offers a selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages.PaymentThe hotel accepts the following credit cards: American Express, VISA, Diners Club, JCB and MasterCard."
