_:n571f7fa2e91941cfab25282868435ce6xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Directly on a private sandy beach in Madinat Makadi, this 5-star resort offers modern rooms with satellite TV and a private balcony. Facilities include an outdoor pool and tennis courts. Guests can spend the day on magnificent Makadi's 18-hole Golf Course, with fully stocked Pro Shop. All rooms of Iberotel Makadi Beach are equipped with air conditioning, a minibar, and a personal safe. Some have panoramic views of the Red Sea, others overlook the garden. Feel light and beautiful with our spa, which includes offers reviving and reinvigorating treatments, massages, relaxation programs and beauty services at an extra charge. Guests can take part in water polo and aqua gym classes at the heated outdoor pool. Guests can enjoy windsurfing, diving, snorkeling and horse riding at an extra charge. Babysitting services are also available at added fees. The resort has 4 restaurants including an Oriental restaurant, a pool restaurant and a Beach restaurant. The 4 bars offer a wide variety of drinks, including exotic cocktails, fresh fruit juices available. The property also offers a regular shuttle bus service to and from Hurghada Airport, which lies about 30 km in the north of the hotel against charge."
