_:n1fd4ee60b386457e8a684299f8a5292dxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Built-in 1999 next to Al Montazah Gardens, El Maamoura, The resort offers the ultimate modern style, coupled with unparalleled services. Paradise Inn Beach Resort is reputable for its hospitality in offering you a high standard of service, whether you are traveling for business, seeking a romantic getaway, or a spectacular family adventure. The hotel is rich with its own private white sandy beach, an outdoor pool, and a kids pool which is all surrounded by colorful flowers and trees for an outstanding experience. All rooms and suites are equipped with a coffee tray, satellite TV, free WI-FI, mini bar, toiletries kit, slippers, hairdryer, balcony, parking, in-house laundry service, individually controlled air-conditioning, and 24 hours room service. All suites feature private jacuzzi,enjoy a dip in the hot tub without stepping foot outside your suite, relax in your in-suite Jacuzzi Escape to paradise in a direct beach bungalow to Enjoy the ultimate luxury of staying in a spacious and cozy bungalow that overlooks the stunning sea. Relax on your private terrace, soak up the sun on the sandy beach, or take a dip in the crystal-clear water. Whether you\\u2019re looking for a romantic getaway, a family vacation, or a solo adventure, our direct beach bungalow is the perfect choice for you to experience the best of comfort and nature. You can enjoy the finest meals at Sky Yacht Beach restaurant directly facing the mediterranean sea features a daily live performance, night cinema also there is White angel restaurant with pool view."
