_:nfad566414e264c17997cdcb06d0f3dd0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"DoubleTree by Hilton Kuala Lumpur is located at The Intermark, an integrated corporate office tower and retail destination. Found at the Golden Triangle intersection of Jalan Ampang and Jalan Tun Razak while crossing into the renowned Embassy Row, the hotel presents an integrated hub for business, vacations and convenient shopping experiences \\u2013 all strategically positioned within a 15 minute walk leading to the world famous Petronas Twin Towers and Suria KLCC shopping mall. The shopping mecca of Bukit Bintang combining Pavilion KL, Lot 10 and Starhill is only a short train ride away from the hotel via a covered walkway leading to the LRT Station (Ampang Park). Renowned for its signature DoubleTree chocolate chip cookie welcome upon check-in, the hotel offers 540 contemporary rooms and 5 dining outlets, 14 meeting rooms and 1 Grand Ballroom spanning 37,000 sq. ft. of meeting spaces. Touted as the true showcase of Malaysian dining, Makan Kitchen \\u2013 the hotel\\u2019s award-winning signature restaurant \\u2013 is a hub for culinary actions where chefs dish up recipes from six Malaysian local cuisines: served from three distinctive, live and interactive kitchens."
