_:n8062c165e13e4c8c9a2b5d1b8d53ec16xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Commodore offers stylish airport accommodation only ten minutes from central Christchurch. Enjoy a relaxing stay in our idyllic award-winning native New Zealand gardens. You can be assured of a tranquil stay complete with indoor swimming pool, spa, sauna and gymnasium, onsite tennis court. Relax on The Terrace, our new outdoor entertainment experience featuring outdoor dining option with gas fire and LCD television. If golf is your game, ask about the international golf course right at our door step. The hotel features 157 guest accommodation rooms, conference and meeting facilities and extensive free parking. Comprehensive FREE WIFI throughout the Hotel. Our 24/7 free shuttle service to and from Christchurch International Airport makes getting to the hotel a breeze. If you are arriving in Christchurch by air, upon your arrival at Christchurch Airport please use the free phone located in the arrivals hall to arrange your complimentary 24hr airport pickup. If you wish to explore the city or South Island, enquire about our on site car rental service, free pass for the regular public bus or complimentary bike hire. We're a family-owned business with an international name. We pride ourselves on delivering a genuine accommodation experience with guests known by their names, not just their room numbers."
