_:n00503f31a90f493b9b9ad996fad338a4xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Featuring stunning views of the Red Sea and the Sinai desert mountains, this hotel in Naama Bay offers rooms with a private balcony or terrace. Facilities include an outdoor pool. The air-conditioned rooms of Eden Rock Hotel are decorated with wooden furniture and large windows. All rooms have satellite TV, a minibar, and an en suite bathroom. Some rooms have a seating area. Guests can enjoy local and international cuisine in main restaurant Fever, which overlooks the pool. Pool bar Parrot offers a wide variety of drinks and panoramic views. Indoor bar Wave is open 24/7. A staircase leads from Eden Rock’s pool area to a private, sandy beach area and Naama Bay’s marina. The hotel also offers massage services, laundry facilities, and a 24-hour reception. Several shops, restaurants and bars are within walking distance of Eden Rock Hotel. Sharm el-Sheikh International Airport is just 15 km from the hotel."
