_:n5252f220eaf9428b84bb41e7a23fae7cxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located in the city center and overlooking the Indian Ocean, the Hilton Colombo hotel is ideally located close to key Colombo tourist and business destinations. Renowned for its dining, this Colombo hotel boasts six specialty restaurants and an extensive choice of event space including eleven meeting rooms and a pillar-less Grand Ballroom that accommodates up to 900 guests. The Hilton Colombo hotel is 45 minutes away from Bandaranaike International Airport and is the only hotel to be linked by a walkway to Colombo's World Trade Centre. Business guests can stay productive during their stay with a 24-hour business center and an Executive Lounge. All Hilton Colombo hotel accommodations feature high-speed internet access. Swim laps of the Hilton Colombo hotel's 90-foot outdoor pool, keep fit in gym or unwind in the sauna. Explore nearby Colombo attractions like the Fort district, Galle Face esplanade and its exotic shops. Sip award-winning cocktails at this Colombo hotel's Poolside Bar or enjoy a fun night with friends in the karaoke lounge. Savor a meal in the open-air Curry Leaf restaurant showcasing the best of Sri Lankan cuisine and seafood."
