_:nbd1b800b72e749c6829d2c9c869d70d3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Welcome to Hilton Garden Inn Bordeaux Centre, set in the heart of Bordeaux. We’re ideally located near Bordeaux train station, so you can get around the city with ease by train or tram. We’re located just three tram stops from the iconic Place de la Bourse. Opéra National, Cité du Vin and Bordeaux Métropole Aréna are all just 10 minutes away by tram, while the Palais des Congrès is reachable within 20 minutes. Enjoy delicious lunch options in our unique restaurant and café store, Babette. Work out in our fully equipped fitness room or relax in the comfort of your guest room. We offer two conference rooms, a boardroom and a ballroom, all offering the benefit of natural light, for your next Bordeaux meeting or event. Our hotel boasts stunning riverside views and offers private parking."
