_:ncca27ef8d36c4c5989e84e172cb2375dxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Crowne Plaza Terrigal Pacific offers ocean facing deluxe accommodation on the NSW Central Coast, just 90 minutes from Sydney. Featuring its own furnished balcony and either a deluxe king bed or two queen beds, each of the 199 generously sized and light filled guest rooms and suites will make you feel welcome from the moment you arrive. Terrigal is known for great restaurants, cafes and bars. You will have a host of options right on your doorstep when looking for somewhere to eat or drink, but you’ll find it hard to go past the ocean views and fresh seasonal menus in the restaurants and bars at Crowne Plaza Terrigal Pacific. Visit our newest jewel, Meribella, with old-world hospitality in an iconic seaside location. Enjoy the season inspired menu by Chef Joshua Mason, or enjoy time in the bar with light fare and on of the legendary cocktails. If you’re looking to dine beachside, Terrigal Beach House has live entertainment on weekends on the Beach Terrace overlooking Terrigal beach. For additional indulgence, book a treatment at the onsite endota spa or sit back and take in the sweeping ocean views from the outdoor heated pool. The hotel's location makes it the perfect getaway where you can wake to the sound of the ocean and enjoy being located in the heart of Terrigal. The hotel's location makes it the perfect getaway where you can wake to the sound of the ocean and enjoy being located in the heart of Terrigal."
