_:n5d9ae83664d3468c9c26881fe33a787cxb0	http://schema.org/description	"With proximity to the main Hamburg train station, our Hampton by Hilton Hamburg City Centre hotel is a smart choice for travelers. Learn about the area with historical landmark pictures spread throughout the hotel. Walk to the business district, restaurants and attractions. Unwind in your quiet room on a clean and comfy Hampton bed while watching your favorite shows on the 32-inch HDTV or catching up with emails on the free WiFi. Wake up to fresh coffee and tea made in the comfort of your own room. Enjoy our daily hot breakfast, included with your stay. A laptop-sized safe, work desk with adjustable lamp and iron and ironing board help make this room feel like home. Ask our friendly team about high chairs, rooms with a sofa bed and child-friendly breakfast options. Host an event in our unique meeting space for up to 10 people, with plenty of natural light. You and your guests will enjoy the 24-hour fitness center with a variety of cardio and weights as well as the 24-hour Lobby Bar."
