_:nd102998753e445a9b71545b3970729fcxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Boasting a prime beachfront location overlooking the Black Sea, the contemporary Hilton Batumi hotel offers easy access to all of the attractions, entertainment, dining, nightlife and shopping of Batumi's city center. Just a 10 minute drive from Batumi Airport, our stylish Georgia hotel is an ideal base for both business and leisure guests, featuring a wealth of fantastic business and leisure facilities. For your comfort and convenience, our hotel offers 181 car parking spaces onsite. Unwind in a stylish and spacious guest room at this Batumi hotel, equipped with a variety of modern amenities designed to help you relax and stay productive, including internet access and a well-appointed bathroom with a separate bathtub and walk-in shower. Upgrade to a luxurious executive room or suite to enjoy additional space and amenities and exclusive access to the Executive Lounge. With nine flexible meeting spaces, a 24-hour business center, the latest A/V technology and a professional events staff, this contemporary hotel in Batumi is perfect for successful corporate functions and spectacular celebrations. Enjoy breakfast in the bright and airy, all-day dining restaurant Tandila, before exploring the vibrant resort destination of Batumi. Experience authentic Georgian cuisine in the sumptuous Pelion restaurant, before sipping after-dinner cocktails on the balcony of the stylish rooftop bar, Nephele. Energize with contemporary exercise equipment in the complimentary 24-hour fitness center. Escape from the bustling city to the urban oasis of our tranquil spa, offering a variety of luxurious treatments or relax with a swim in the sparkling indoor pool."
