_:ne5ab2c196714461ca916c5c0f50b3167xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Stay close to the action while enjoying the peace and quiet of the Hilton Munich Park hotel's tranquil location next to the scenic English Garden. Visit famous Schwabing entertainment district, just next to the hotel, or spend the afternoon in one of Munich's lovely beer gardens, within walking distance of the hotel. Only 30 minutes' drive from the airport, this Munich hotel offers 21 meeting rooms for up to 1020, a business center, Executive Lounge and wireless internet access. Complimentary WiFi is available in the public area of the hotel. Enjoy international specialties from the summer terrace at Tivoli Restaurant, sip a beer in the People's Bar or meet for a coffee in lively People's Lounge Lobby Cafe at this central Munich hotel. Revive your senses with a work out, swim laps of the pool or unwind in the sauna at the hotel's Hilton Fitness & Relaxation area. Play golf, go running alongside Isar River, hire a boat or visit nearby Munich attractions like the Olympic Garden. From Guest Rooms to Executive Rooms, all have a balcony and air-conditioning. Stay in an Executive Room and enjoy access to the 12th-floor Executive Lounge offering sweeping views of Munich."
