_:nca0aedf912e544aa815ae2d9d88edbebxb0	http://schema.org/description	"The following services and amenities are available, but with **reduced service**: Business Center, Breakfast, Room Service.The following services and amenities are currently **not available**: Complimentary Evening Social, Executive Lounge, Fitness Center, Golf, On-site Restaurant(s), Pool, Spa, Valet Parking.Set amongst landscaped gardens, the Hilton Sandton hotel is conveniently located in the Sandton business district, to the north of Johannesburg. With easy access to great shopping, the main banking institutions and the Johannesburg Stock Exchange, the hotel is the ideal base for business and leisure guests. Do business in the Executive Lounge or de-stress in the gym or pool. Savor African or Mediterranean cuisine at Tradewinds Restaurant, snack on a sandwich at Faces Bar terrace or sip a cocktail at the Hilton Sandton hotel's Pool Gazebo bar. The hotel's Sushi and Teppanyaki Bar offers a Far Eastern culinary experience, with professional Sushi and Teppanyaki Chefs also providing Sushi lessons to individuals and corporate guests. Keep active at the Hilton Sandton hotel with a set on the tennis court. For something a little more soothing, try an aromatherapy treatment in the spa. Hop on the free shuttle for great shopping at Sandton City just 500 meters away, or explore Johannesburg attractions like Gold Reef City Theme Park. Sandton Convention Center is a 5-minute walk away and there is wireless internet access in the Executive Lounge and 9 meeting rooms for 4-1000. All rooms at the Hilton Sandton hotel feature satellite television and high speed internet access. Guests staying on the Executive Floor enjoy private check-in facilities, complimentary breakfast, drinks, canapes and newspapers."
