_:n851e1399c5a24cfbb63abaeabf361157xb0	http://schema.org/description	"In the old city centre, Hilton The Hague is located only 30 minutes from Amsterdam Schiphol Airport. Within walking distance to the embassy quarter and Peace Palace just steps from the Dutch Parliament. Discover the cobble-stoned streets lined with boutiques, historic sites and famous museums. Scheveningen Beach is just 15 minutes from the hotel by tram. The 195 guest rooms are some of the most spacious in The Hague. They provide a place to unwind or to catch up on work and boast large windows, 37-inch LCD TVs and WiFi. Stay in an Executive Room to enjoy stunning views and access to the Executive Lounge serving complimentary breakfast, canapes and drinks. Unlock your room with the Digital Key via the Hilton Honors App. Discover Nikkei cuisine at BlueBlood, a diverse and adventurous combination between the flavors of Japan and the spicy playful palette that is distinctly Latin American. Enjoy the chance to explore a new world of exciting food and drinks, connect and share stunning dishes. With 4 boardrooms, 5 meeting spaces and an impressive ballroom, Hilton The Hague is the ideal venue to cater to almost every type of event. We can accommodate up to 300 people in the Mesdag Ballroom which is fully divisible into two parts for maximum flexibility. Due to our proximity to the Peace Palace, we are also in a police-protected area, making us suitable for hosting delegations and court cases."
