_:neb3be4eeceb348d695133275b89dd188xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Free Wi-Fi and a breakfast buffet are offered at Hotel-Cafe Demling, located in the centre of Randersacker, a well-known wine-producing town. Rooms feature a flat-screen TV and private bathroom. Hotel-Cafe Demling's rooms come with wooden furniture and cable TV, allergy-free ones are available upon request. Private bathrooms include free toiletries and a hairdryer. In addition to breakfast, Café Demling serves homemade cakes and small meals throughout the day. It has an attached terrace that guests can use during nice weather. The front desk includes a small wine shop and a mail office. Bicycle storage facilities are also available to guests arriving with bicycles. Würzburg Golf Course is 6 km from the hotel. It is 3 km from the A3 motorway and 7 km from the A7 motorway."
