_:n21dc7939bcb84e688d9fe78f674cbeffxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Facing the beachfront, Hotel Riu Palace Jandia offers 5-star accommodation in Playa Jandia and has 2 bars and terrace. Featuring 2 restaurants, the 5-star hotel has air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi. The hotel features an outdoor swimming pool, fitness centre, evening entertainment and a 24-hour front desk. Guest rooms in the hotel are fitted with a flat-screen TV. The private bathroom is equipped with a shower, a hairdryer and free toiletries. A buffet breakfast is available each morning at Hotel Riu Palace Jandia. Spa and wellness facilities are at guests' disposal during their stay at the accommodation.The area is popular for cycling, and car hire is available at this 5-star hotel. Costa Calma is 18 km from Hotel Riu Palace Jandia, while Morro del Jable is 200m from the property. The nearest airport is Fuerteventura Airport, 82 km from the hotel."
