_:nf759b5ae20684460875c78ac1a4ca4c2xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Prestigious hotel close to Aarhus. Montra Hotel Sabro Kro, BW Signature Collection is ideally located in quiet surroundings in Sabro, only 15 km from Aarhus C, but also within easy driving distance to Skanderborg, Silkeborg and Randers. The hotel has a cozy atmosphere and ambience, and it's easy to walk out into nature or head to the many opportunities in the surrounding towns. With an overnight stay at Montra Hotel Sabro Kro, BW Signature Collection you get the full experience of rural surroundings in the Aarhus area and the joy of being close to a big city like Aarhus city center. Here you are close to East Jutland's many attractions such as ARoS, Tivoli Friheden, Den Gamle By, Randers Regnskov and many more. If you have a passion for golf, Montra Hotel Sabro Kro, BW Signature Collection collaborates with several golf clubs nearby, including Hammel Golf Club, Marcusminde Golf Club and Lyngbygaard Golf, which offers one of Denmark's best golf courses. The hotel's restaurant focuses on good food with seasonal ingredients and organic produce. Here, the good chefs take pride in pickling, smoking, baking, boiling and frying in the kitchen, and they take pride in combining the good ingredients into tasty, high-quality food, so you get plenty of flavor in every bite you eat. The restaurant is one of the best eateries and restaurants in the Aarhus area."
