_:ne5705b89bfcb471aa1355363cb7dc8a7xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Come and discover the renewed Riu Palace Macao and try the exclusive Elite Club by Riu*. Enjoy a wonderful location directly on the Playa de Arena Gorda beach, surrounded by coconut palm trees and overlooking the turquoise waters of the Caribbean Sea. It features several excellent dining options, a pool landscape, a fantastic spa area and various sports facilities. Punta Cana International Airport is about 30 km away. *Elite Club Rooms include the following benefits: Premium room locations. Access to premium branded drinks at select bars (Lobby lounge, Lobby bar, and Elite Club Beach). Access to exclusive lounge area with premium branded drinks. Access to reserved beach area with exclusive bar (Elite Club Beach). Access to exclusive restaurants (breakfast a la carte and specialty Elite Club restaurant). Upgraded in-room liquor dispenser with premium brands. Upgraded minibar with snacks and a bottle of wine or cava. Upgraded room service, including vegetarian options. Access to book a table at themed restaurants via Riu app. Guaranteed late check-out confirmed until 1 PM, and early check-in (subject to availability). Exclusive welcome gift. Dedicated check-in area and Elite Club wristband."
