_:n3212849064b2429fa5e01cdc73c4e27fxb0	http://schema.org/description	"SBH Club Paraíso Playa is a modern hotel in a fantastic location right near the beach front and directly overlooking the sea. Boasting a unique view of the Esquinzo beach and its surroundings, the large double rooms at the Paraíso also have a terrace or balcony, and good facilities. Drink in hand, bask in the sunshine on the sun loungers around the two large outdoor pools, or go for a cooling swim. Head back into the hotel to enjoy lunch at the restaurant, or sip sangria at the bar. Treat yourself to a massage, whirlpool or Turkish bath. Keep active by taking advantage of the wide range of sports included in your rate, such as tennis, table and paddle tennis, and volleyball, or work up a sweat at the gym. Then at night, have a great time with your friends and family at one of the hotel-organized entertainment shows, on six nights a week."
