_:n0c1c5c329c5746598cf1c7bee13dbf71xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This elegant hotel, 50 metres from Fuerteventura’s Costa Calma Beach, features indoor and outdoor pools, a spa and free parking. All air-conditioned rooms have a private balcony with sea views. The SBH Costa Calma Palace & Spa offers 2 tennis courts, a giant chess board, and a golf area with a putting green. You can also go windsurfing and diving for an additional charge. The large, bright rooms at the SBH Costa Calma Palace & Spa come with satellite TV. You can rent a safe, and the private bathroom is equipped with a hairdryer. Guests can relax in the Costa Calma Palace thalassotherapy spa, with its indoor seawater swimming pool and treatments. There is a gym and sauna, and massage is available. The hotel has a restaurant and 2 bars. You can also have lunch or a drink at the poolside snack bar. Live music and shows are offered daily."
