_:n0dd97c4afe134b41bc23dda56ca985c9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Rooms Make yourself at home in one of the 46 air-conditioned guestrooms. Bathrooms have showers and complimentary toiletries. Conveniences include desks, and housekeeping is provided on request. Amenities Take in the views from a garden and make use of amenities such as tour/ticket assistance and a picnic area. Business}, Other Amenities Featured amenities include coffee/tea in a common area and a water dispenser. Guests may use a ferry terminal shuttle for a surcharge, and free self parking is available onsite. Property Location When you stay at Sandy Beach Resort Langkawi in Langkawi, you'll be near the beach, within a 5-minute walk of Pantai Cenang Beach and Cenang Mall. This hotel is 13.5 mi (21.7 km) from Langkawi Terminal Ferry and 13.5 mi (21.8 km) from Kuah Jetty. Dining Satisfy your appetite with Malaysian cuisine at D'GRILL SEAFOOD, a beachfront restaurant which features an ocean view. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe. Mandatory Charges You'll be asked to pay the following charges at the property: Deposit: MYR 100 per accommodation, per stay A tax is imposed by the city: MYR 1.00 per accommodation, per night Management fee: MYR 50 per accommodation, per stay We have included all charges provided to us by the property. Check-In Checkin starts at 3:00 PM Checkin end at 10:00 PM Extra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy Government-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges Special requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed This property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted Noise-free guestrooms cannot be guaranteed Safety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a smoke detector, a security system, and a first aid kit Be prepared: check the latest COVID-19 travel requirements and measures in place for this destination before you travel. There is no front desk at this property. This property doesn't offer after-hours check-in. The host will greet guests on arrival. Check-Out Checkout is done at 12:00 PM Pets Pets not allowed Service animals not allowed General instructions No rollaway/extra beds available No cribs (infant beds) available Noise-free rooms not guaranteed Essential workers only - NO Property is cleaned with disinfectant Guests are provided with free hand sanitizer Property follows regional sanitization guidelines Safe & Clean (Malaysia) Property confirms they are implementing enhanced cleaning measures Bed sheets and towels are washed at a temperature of at least 60°C/140°F Commonly-touched surfaces are cleaned with disinfectant Property confirms they are implementing guest safety measures Guest accommodation is sealed after cleaning Electrostatic spray is used for disinfection Property follows sanitization practices of COVID-19 Guidelines (CDC) Property does not offer onsite COVID-19 testing Property does not require health documentation at check-in"
