_:n8ea2bbbac706405197fc36d13b08fe5cxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Upscale suburban hotel near Aso Kuju National Park This hotel features 2 restaurants, a full-service spa, and an indoor pool. Free WiFi in public areas, free self parking, and free train station pick-up are also provided. Other amenities include an outdoor pool, a fitness center, and a bar/lounge. Suginoi Hotel offers 587 accommodations with safes and slippers. Flat-screen televisions are featured in guestrooms. Bathrooms include toilets with an electronic bidet, hair dryers, and toothbrushes and toothpaste. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Housekeeping is offered daily and irons/ironing boards can be requested. 2 spa tubs are on site along with an indoor pool and an outdoor pool. In addition to a children's pool, other recreational amenities include a sauna and a fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply."
