_:n7cfd3650c4964deabdb8305dc34ca78fxb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Teda Swiss Inn Plaza Hotel is set amidst lush gardens at the entrance of Chinese- Egyptian Economic Zone. Guests can make use of the free WiFi in the entire hotel, the pool and the 24-hour room service. The modern, air-conditioned rooms at Teda Swiss Inn feature balconies overlooking the pool and garden. Each offers a flat-screen TV, a desk, a mini bar and wardrobe. A shower is fitted in the bathroom. A buffet-style breakfast is served daily. Hot drinks are offered at the coffee shops. Refreshing cocktails are found at the Fun Pub and bar. Guests can enjoy an energizing workout at the gym or relaxing massage treatments at the spa complemented by the billiards and the games room available on site. Wonderful & colored new escape family hotel extension for families with kids. Aqua Park has 2 swimming pools and 1 heated swimming pool for children. The Fun Valley features 31 real size dinosaurs and variety of games. Auto World offers racing experiences to guests. Guests also have access to a lovely beach away 15 minutes from our hotel by free shuttle bus every hour till sun set. Cairo is 120 km away. Ironing and laundry can be arranged by the 24-hour front desk. Free private parking is possible on site. you will be eligible for 01 free card for each room to enjoy our amusement park “Teda Fun Valley” to have fun with your kids, this card will give you 200 points every day."
