_:n1adcdbd2e5cd48f4aa56aab66965315bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated along the city side of Chaopraya River, The Siam features luxury accommodation with modern facilities. Designed by internationally acclaimed architect Bill Bensley, it boasts an outdoor pool and on-site parking facilities. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. The Siam is located 3 km away from Vimanmek Teak Palace and 5 km away from the popular Grand Palace. Suvarnabhumi International Airport is located 35 km away. Free shuttle boat from the hotel to Sathorn Pier is available from 10:00-18:00 hrs. The villas and the suite are tastefully decorated and equipped with air conditioning, a TV and a minibar. Guests can also enjoy a fresh fruit basket and access to unlimited local phone calls. All stylish bathrooms are fitted with a bathtub and shower facilities. Guests can work out at the well-equipped fitness centre, relax at the spa or curl up with a book at the library. Other services available include a 24-hour front desk, currency exchange and babysitting. Butler services are also available for extra convenience. Set within a cluster of three Thai teak wood houses, Chon Thai Restaurant offers delicious Thai cuisine. Other dining options include Deco Bar & Bistro. Inspired by the jazzy ambiance combined with black and white interiors, it serves international cuisines, as well as cocktails and a great selection of wine."
