_:nbba4f18d72a443e3bfbf2fa867d6c631xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The White Hart is located in Sherington, 8 miles from Milton Keynes and within 15 miles from Northampton and Bedford. Guests can enjoy the on-site restaurant and bar for lunch and evening meals. Free WiFi is available throughout. All rooms are equipped with a flat-screen TV. You will find a kettle and ironing facilities in the room. For your comfort, you will find free toiletries and a hairdryer. Guests can enjoy a cooked breakfast. Oxford is 46 miles from the property, and Cambridge is 44 miles away. The nearest airport is London Luton Airport, 26.5 miles from The White Hart. The M1 motorway, junction 14, is just 4 miles from the property."
