_:n0aa9ac6f69d54097817691e08d8110aexb0	http://schema.org/description	"Conveniently located in Güterbahnhof, a new area of the city, Hampton by Hilton Freiburg is close to museums, restaurants, shopping centers and the historic old town. Freiburg Minster cathedral is a 10-minute drive away, and the main metro station is a 15-minute walk away, allowing you to explore the city. Enjoy easy access to the Black Forest, a scenic forested mountain range, one hour away by car from our Freiburg hotel. Relax and feel at home in your modern guest room. Watch the 40-inch smart TV or surf the web with free WiFi. Every room at our Freiburg hotel features a comfy bed, a large work desk, individually controlled air conditioning, tea/coffee facilities and a laptop-size safe. Select a family room to enjoy courtyard views and a sofa bed in the seating area. Accessible rooms are also available that include all the standard amenities plus extra features for your comfort. Wake up each morning to Hampton’s hot breakfast, included in your stay and available Monday to Friday 6am – 10am, Saturday and Sunday 6am – 11am. We also have a 24/7 hub with snacks, single serve drinks and amenities. Keep on top of your exercise routine in our onsite fitness center with cardio and weights equipment."
