_:n225b3342b76b4d22bb24ddc6ced816f3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located along Nusa Dua Beach Bali Relaxing Resort and Spa houses an outdoor swimming pool and 2 dining options. Free Wi-Fi is accessible in all areas. Bali Relaxing Resort and Spa is within a 15-minute drive from Bali Collection Nusa Dua and a 30-minute drive from Ngurah Rai International Airport. The hotel can arrange for airport pick-up services at a charge. Elegant rooms boast modern interiors and big windows, allowing much natural light in. A flat-screen TV, minibar and tea/coffee-making facilities are included in all units. Shower facilities and free toiletries are provided in the attached bathroom. Surrounded by coconut trees, the luxurious hotel offers far-reaching views of the ocean. Guests can take a stroll in the landscaped gardens or pamper themselves at the spa & wellness centre. Luggage storage and a safety deposit box are available at the 24-hour front desk. Indonesian and international specialties are served at the on-site restaurant and coffee shop. Guests can have cocktails and non-alcoholic drinks at the hotel’s lounge and bar. Room service is offered upon request."
