_:n8276e652be6d4384af06b420c1a151f6xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Superbly located, our DoubleTree by Hilton London Hyde Park hotel is opposite Hyde Park and Kensington Gardens and just 400 meters from either Queensway or Bayswater Underground stations. For great shopping, we are just 3 stops from Oxford Street or the renowned Westfield shopping centre. With Kings Cross St Pancreas only a 12-minute taxi ride away, we are perfectly situated for guests travelling on the Eurostar and only one stop from Paddington where the superb Heathrow express train provides quick access to London’s premier airport. Spacious guest rooms boast a long list of guest amenities including a generous work surface, flat-screen TV and WiFi. For your convenience, complimentary WiFi is also available in public areas on the ground floor. The hotel has a superb restaurant where we serve breakfast, lunch and dinner with a range of seasonal dishes for you to enjoy. The bar is available until 11pm, perfect for a nightcap after a trip to the theatre. Complimentary WiFi is available in both bar and restaurant so whether at work or play you are easily connected. Alternatively, put your feet up and let dinner come to you with 24-hour room service. DoubleTree by Hilton London Hyde Park hotel has 2 modern purpose-built meeting rooms, which have capacities from 2 to 15 people, all with natural daylight and free WiFi access. Our staff is happy to provide audio-visual equipment, including laptops on request. Our hotel is close to the city’s main tourist attractions, business district, shops, restaurants and entertainment venues, making it the perfect starting point for a visit to the city. So, whether you're on business or enjoying a relaxing break, DoubleTree by Hilton London Hyde Park hotel has what it takes to make your stay a memorable one."
