_:n525db5787f5e46a3b6e8dca919f88674xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The island location, natural values, well prepared infrastructure and a refreshing breeze of the Baltic See will welcome you at Hampton by Hilton Swinoujscie. The hotel is situated in the new part of the city and in the neighbourhood of the Platan shopping centre. The attractiveness of the Hampton by Hilton is emphasized by its exceptional location - it is only a few minutes walk from the seaside promenade and the most beautiful beach at the Baltic Sea. This is the beach that is the greatest attraction of Swinoujscie, the widest in Poland, it has been tempting with its exceptionally soft and clean sand for years. It is perfect for sunbathing and evening walks in the setting sun. The hotel is situated merely 1.5 km from the Polish border with Germany, which contributes to the fact that German Baltic resorts, such as Albeck, Heringsdorf and Basim, are within arm’s reach. Our hotel is also a perfect place for relaxation for Scandinavia enthusiasts. A sea ferry terminal in Swinoujscie provides regular connections with Sweden and Denmark. Everyday ferries set off to Copenhagen and Ystad offering one-day cruises and unforgettable experience while visiting these charming places. The hotel Hampton by Hilton Swinoujscie's building is modern, spacious and perfectly supplements the architecture and character of the city. The hotel is decorated with exceptional taste. Warm, air-conditioned interiors are maintained in bright colours, the original decor and modern and carefully selected room equipment make each Guest feel comfortable there, regardless of the nature of their journey, whether it is a short business trip or a few days’ rest.   Best tastes and aromas of the region will charm the most demanding guest. On your culinary journey you will meet numerous local delicacies abounding in fish from the local catch and natural raw materials. The table is dominated by both the seafood of the Baltic Sea and delicacies of the traditional Polish cuisine. Dishes of highest quality, prepared according to proven recipes, guarantee that taste sensations will be remembered for a long time. You can also enjoy a free hot breakfast with us every morning. With its interior, Hampton by Hilton is perfectly suitable for persons travelling on business. Two conference rooms will satisfy completely the requirements for the organization of business meetings and conferences. The hotel offers a spacious place for work and free wireless internet access, but these are just a few out of many business facilities. The neighbourhood of a beautiful area encourages to combine a business trip with relaxation: in the vicinity there are the Sea Fishery Museum, Fortification, Breakwaters, historical Churches or the incredible Lighthouse. It is only a part of attractions that will take us to the incredible atmosphere of the island of Uznam. Due to its exceptional geographical location and diverse area, Swinoujscie offers perfect conditions for practicing the entire range of types of tourism, sport or recreation. Sea water, the neighbourhood of forests, islets, fauna and flora of the surrounding nature reserve of the Wolinski National Park encourage to active relaxation. In the vicinity, within the area of the Northern Basin, there is a yacht port, where 150 medium-size vessels may moor at the same time. The surroundings and sea winds of Swinoujscie are perfect conditions for windsurfing and kite surfing. It is also possible to have a go at canoeing on the broads of the old Swina River. There are modern bicycle trails awaiting the two wheel enthusiasts. At arm’s length there is also a perfect bicycle infrastructure of the German part of the Uznam Island. Whatever the purpose of your visit at Hampton by Hilton Swinoujscie, we always heartily welcome our Guests, and the professional team is always at your disposal. We endeavour to make your visit at Hampton by Hilton unforgettable and we will be pleased to welcome you again."
_:n525db5787f5e46a3b6e8dca919f88674xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Hampton by Hilton Swinoujscie"
