_:n5e367872f1dd4c02a5c0408958d12d81xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hotel Esperance is an Art d\\u00E9co hotel situated in the heart of Brussels, just around the corner from the City2 Mall and Rue Neuve, and 10 minutes' walk from the Grand-Place. Each of the design rooms is unique in style and decoration. A private wellness centre is 30 metres from the property. Hotel Esperance offers warmly decorated guest rooms, each with an LCD TV and free Wi-Fi. The bathrooms are luxurious in style and have either a spacious shower or a spa bath. A small breakfast buffet is served daily in Esperance\\u2019s tavern with its stained-glass windows and Art Deco decorations. Guests can also enjoy light meals for lunch and dinner in this special setting. As a nice addition, the hotel offers Segways for rent. The Esperance Hotel is located 200 metres from the De Brouckere Metro Station, which offers direct access to Schuman and the European Institutions. The Manneken Pis Statue is a 10-minute walk away."
