_:n1793d169a4a64607b7a25abe6231134fxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Vouk Hotel & Suites provides a comfortable setting while in Nusa Dua. It features 5-star rooms with a private bathroom equipped with a rain shower. There are a variety of facilities available to those staying at the hotel, including meeting rooms, a kids pool and massage services. For those travelling with children Vouk Hotel & Suites offers babysitting\\/child services. Rooms feature a modern d\\u00E9cor, air-conditioning and a private balcony. They all offer tea and coffee making facilities, a flat-screen TV and slippers. Vouk Hotel & Suites features both a restaurant and a bar where guests are able to relax of an evening. Breakfast is available each morning and can be enjoyed in the comfort of the rooms. The hotel is under a 25-minute drive from Ngurah Rai International Airport. Kuta and Jimbaran are also an easy car ride away."
