_:n2fe19f4a268a462ea101f3d1dd0b3b51xb0	http://schema.org/description	"We\\u2019re conveniently located less than 5 minutes from Luton Airport terminal via the DART passenger transit system, which is just outside the hotel. We\\u2019re also right next to Luton Parkway Train Station, which offers direct access to St. Pancras International Station in less than 25 minutes. Enjoy comfortable rooms, each with a bathroom with walk-in power shower, free high-speed internet access and air-conditioning. Hampton by Hilton Luton Airport features an on-site fitness center which is open 24 hours a day. Freshly cooked bacon and sausage are served with breakfast, along with Hampton's signature waffles. Evening meals are provided in the hotel bar and dining area. A range of Italian, Indian and Chinese restaurants can be found in Luton town center, which is a 20-minute walk from the hotel."
