_:n80c00d43974b4c85aa8a88bf9dd1f24cxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Rising a stunning 34 stories above the city, this 5star hotel in prestigious Etiler district enjoys a prime location from which to explore the prolific historic landmarks and many stylish restaurants, bars and boutiques Istanbul has to offer. Bask in unique panoramic views over the Bosphorus and Istanbul iconic bridges. Unlock Istanbuls best experiences from our luxury hotel while relaxing in a private cabana by the outdoor pool, indulging in a traditional hammam or savoring classic Turkish dishes with a modern twist. A creative tribute to modernity and tradition, our 255 rooms and suites blend chic contemporary artwork and furnishings with classic Turkish motifs. Floor to ceiling windows frame stunning uninterrupted views of the city and the Bosphorus which offers spectacular luxury. Our hotel is pet friendly and welcomes trained pets for a fee. Host your next meeting or event at our conference hotel. We offer over 2500 sqm of event space, plenty of onsite parking and superb catering."
