_:nbd3d0d95e92741b8a3093f0f53772b53xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated 240 metres above the town of Sundsvall, this hotel offers fantastic views, a popular rooftop spa and a games hall. Both WiFi and private parking are free. Skiing opportunities at Sundsvalls Slalombacke are only a few steps away. A flat-screen TV and work desk are featured in Hotell S\\u00F6dra Berget\\u2019s modern guest rooms. Each is decorated with warm colours and dark wood furnishings with impressive views over the city. Spa facilities include an exclusive spa area with several pools and saunas. Bookable treatments are also available, and reservations are highly recommended. Strike Club Games Hall offers 16 bowling lanes. a caf\\u00E9 and simulators for golf, hunting and cars. The hotel offers 2 restaurants with varying menus, from salads and pizzas to tasty burgers. S\\u00F6dra Berget also has a dance restaurant with occasional weekend entertainment. Reservations must be made in advance. Sundsvall Central Station is 10 minutes\\u2019 drive away. Cross-country ski tracks are located steps away from the hotel."
