_:nc7d5e46e15ca4241afd6b6075fd59912xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Waldorf Astoria Maldives Ithaafushi is a luxury destination resort spanning across three islands, encircling a turquoise blue lagoon. Home to spectacular underwater life, this all-villa resort is a 45-minute yacht journey away from Velana International Airport. Contemporary yet indigenous, graceful and understated, the resort offers a perfect balance between modern architecture and traditional inspirations. This luxurious resort offers 119 beach, reef and overwater villas, with a choice of one, two and three bedroom options. Each villa is secluded, with generous indoor and outdoor spaces. Exquisite interiors open onto a terrace and deck with an infinity pool and uninterrupted views of the azure lagoon. The stunning Ithaafushi - The Private Island is only accessible by boat, and with nine bedrooms across three villas, it is the epitome of exclusivity and luxury. The Island also boasts its own spa, gym, entertainment center, 25-meter outdoor pool, pristine beach and exotic garden as well as a dedicated personal concierge and culinary team. Extraordinary culinary experiences await at Waldorf Astoria Maldives Ithaafushi. From elevated treetop dining at Terra to cave-like private dining at the Rock, from a delectable Arabian selection at Yasmeen to authentic Chinese dishes at Li Long, everyone will find something to tease their palate. Unwind with a drink in the cozy ambience of Peacock Alley, or sip champagne while watching the sunset at Amber, opening directly onto the ocean. Discover extensive onsite activities including the expansive Waldorf Astoria spa with 10 exquisite treatment villas boasting ocean views, a VIP spa suite, vitality pool, a beauty salon and an indoor\\/outdoor mind and body studio. There is also a fully equipped fitness center, yoga pavilion, water sports, diving center, curated excursions and more to keep you active."
