_:n1b9f6faec35741e78e5b9f610eadd188xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Once the tallest building in Albuquerque, Hotel Andaluz Albuquerque, Curio Collection by Hilton was the fourth hotel by Conrad Hilton, built in 1939. Set in the heart of downtown, our meticulously restored, Four Diamond Award-winning and Gold LEED Certified hotel is close to top attractions, events and the Sandia Mountains. Unwind in our stylish guest rooms, featuring unique artwork from around the world and Spanish-inspired design. Each room includes premium bath amenities, a signature Andaluz robe, luxury linens and complimentary WiFi. Pamper yourself and upgrade to our Penthouse suite with separate living and dining area, sofa bed, powder room, copper soaking tub and Bose sound system. Explore the combination of artistry and flavor for a unique dining experience at M\\u00C1S Tapas y Vino. Sip a signature cocktail while enjoying live entertainment at Ibiza Urban Rooftop Lounge, featuring views of the Sandia Mountains and downtown Albuquerque. For a more intimate experience, dine in our private lobby casbahs or order room service for a luxurious night in. With 7,000 sq. ft. of meeting and event space, Hotel Andaluz is the ideal setting for your wedding, conference, executive retreat or special event. With traditional and unique event spaces such as our Barcelona Ballroom, Library and Rooftop Lounge, we can accommodate events up to 600 people. Other amenities include complimentary fitness club access, a business center and Mercado, featuring local bites and treasures."
