_:ndd8468fbbb134c29a1c29d4655e6260dxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Featuring an outdoor pool as well as spa and wellness centre, Java Palace Hotel is located in Cikarang. Free WiFi is available in all areas. Rooms are equipped with flat-screen satellite TV and safety deposit box. En suite bathrooms come with shower, free toiletries and towels. Electric kettle as well as a minibar is also provided. Guests can enjoy a game of billiards and mini golf at an additional charge. Offering a fitness centre, the hotel provides meeting facilities, on-site free parking and a 24-hour front desk with fax\\/photocopying and baggage storage. A sauna is also available on-site and can be used free of charge. A convenience store is just a 5-minute walk away from the property. Airlangga Restaurant on-site serves Indonesian, western, Japanese and Korean cuisine. Java Palace Hotel is a 5-minute walk to Plaza JB and 15-minute drive from Lippo Cikarang Waterbom. Soekarno-Hatta International Airport is 68 km away."
