_:ncbae15c0968245f9b41fb34ad137fec5xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Best Western Plus Plaza Hotel Darmstadt is not only characterized by its modern facilities but also by its location and accessibility. Especially business travellers appreciate the proximity of approx. 100m to the main railway station as well as the optimal connection to the freeway roads (A67 and A5). This ensures that even Frankfurt Airport and the trade fair centre in the metropolis are within easy reach. To the city centre it is only 2.5 km or 5 minutes by tram in front of the hotel. In addition to the spacious restaurant and bar area, the hotel has a newly renovated wellness floor with a view over the city, furnished with pool, sauna, steam bath, fitness and relaxation room. Guests can choose from 248 rooms in different categories. 104 standard rooms, as many comfort rooms, 4 business suites. In addition, the hotel offers 40 rooms, which can be used for a family stay with up to 4 persons. With 11 conference rooms, the hotel offers the largest range of rooms for conferences, seminars and meetings in Darmstadt. Three of these conference rooms offer space for a maximum of 220 people each. The hotel has an underground car park with 110 parking spaces"
