_:n4816e6c1ee2243a397e0bcea7efdc4b1xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Ocean-view hotel with a swim-up bar, near Sanur Beach At Prama Sanur Beach Bali, hit the beach, dine onsite at Tirta Poolside Restaurant, or enjoy a drink at one of the hotel's 3 bars\\/lounges. Prama Sanur Beach Bali offers 428 air-conditioned accommodations, which are accessible via exterior corridors and feature safes and complimentary bottled water. Rooms open to balconies. Televisions come with cable channels. Guests can make use of the in-room coffee\\/tea makers and minibars. Bathrooms include showers and hair dryers. Additionally, rooms include irons\\/ironing boards and blackout drapes\\/curtains. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. An outdoor pool and a children's pool are on site. Other recreational amenities include a waterslide and a fitness center. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply."
