_:n27b16a42379f4743a9a7b05076d8e612xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Occupying a beach front location, Club Paradisio is situated in El Gouna just minutes drive away from the 18 hole golf course Club House. It offers 3 swimming pools, a fitness centre and a retail shopping arcade. All rooms at Club Paradisio feature a balcony overlooking the pool, sea and lush gardens. Each one offers a flat-screen TV, a minibar and a telephone. The suite includes a separate living room and a dining area. There is a wide choice of culinary delights at Club Paradisio such as Marco Polo Restaurant that serves Egyptian Cuisine to Morgan that offers sea food. Cocktails and mocktails are served at the pool and main lobby bar. Club Paradisio El Gouna Red Sea offers an impressive selection of sports activities such snorkeling, diving, beach volley ball and tennis. Diving lessons are also available through the club academies. Downtown ElGouna is 1 km from Club Paradisio. Hurghada\\u2019s International Airport is 20 km away. Free private parking is possible on site."
