_:n0eb3a69a10d14c76b31759892825f20bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Set amidst the scenic hills of the Thermenregion of Styria and Burgenland, the 4-star Thermenhof PuchasPLUS Loipersdorf is set 1,200 metres from the Loipersdorf Thermal Spa, and 4 km from the 27-hole golf course of Loipersdorf. Guests receive a green fee discount. The spacious, allergy-free rooms and apartments at the PuchasPLUS feature Swiss stone pine furniture, orthopaedic mattresses, air conditioning and a balcony or a sun terrace. The rich breakfast buffet offers regional and organic products as well as homemade marmalade and baked goods. Vegetarian and vegan dishes are available as well. Guests of the Thermenhof PuchasPLUS can relax in the lounge with a tiled stove, in the winter garden, in the garden or in the infrared cabin. Free WiFi and free parking are provided. Typical local vine taverns can be found in the surrounding, and hiking and cycling paths are accessible directly from the property. Bicycles can be rented on site. Twice a week Thermenhof PuchasPLUS Loipersdorf offers guided cycling and hiking tours, as well as Nordic walking excursions. The golf courses in Bad Waltersdorf, Stegersbach and Bad Gleichenberg are within a 30-minute drive. The centre of Loipersdorf and the public outdoor pool in Jennersdorf is a 5-minute drive away. Graz is 60 km away, and Vienna is 150 km from the property."
