_:nb1c1c0cfa6a5456ca2e7e2f10b28c1f9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Copaiba by Honne Hotels features an outdoor swimming pool, fitness centre, a shared lounge and terrace in Playa de Palma. Featuring a restaurant, the 3-star hotel has air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi, each with a private bathroom. Guests can make use of a bar. All units in the hotel are equipped with a flat-screen TV with cable channels. Copaiba by Honne Hotels provides certain units with pool views, and rooms have a balcony. At the accommodation every room has bed linen and towels. Copaiba by Honne Hotels offers a buffet or continental breakfast. Languages spoken at the reception include German, English and Spanish. Playa de Palma Beach is 500 metres from the hotel, while Can Pastilla Beach is 2.5 km away. The nearest airport is Palma de Mallorca Airport, 4 km from Copaiba by Honne Hotels."
