_:nfd01e7e73e114a88936f3e9c8c20403exb0	http://schema.org/description	"Combining a luxurious setting with first-class facilities, Balina Paradise Abu Soma Resort features a swimming pool and a private beach. Those staying at the property also have access to free wireless internet and on-site parking. This luxury resort offers a beauty centre, a kids club and a diving centre. For an easy and effortless check-in and departure experience, guests can take advantage of the express check-in\\/check-out kiosk. Guests can also enjoy miniature golf and horse riding. Rooms at Balina Paradise Abu Soma Resort are well-appointed and offer a mini bar, an in-room safe and a telephone. They feature a private bathroom where a hair dryer can be found. Guests of Balina Paradise Abu Soma Resort are welcome to sample international cuisine at Le Chateau Main Restaurant, or try Italian dishes at Bella Napoli a la carte Restaurant. There is also a range of breakfast options available each morning. Hurghada International Airport is less than a 40-minute drive from the resort. Makadi Bay and Soma Bay are also just a short drive from the property."
