_:n7431cc8163cb442c9dc557543b18960fxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Welcome to Hilton Cabo Verde Sal Resort, a picture-perfect vacation spot in Santa Maria. Sink your toes in the pristine white-sand beach and reach destinations like the extinct Pedra de Lume volcano in minutes. Indulge while you're here with an Eforea Spa and Fitness centre, casino, 4 restaurants and bars, a watersports centre, Kids Club, and 1000 sqm of flexible event space. Sal International Airport is just 10 minutes away. Every large and stylish guest room has comforts like complimentary WiFi, a 40-inch TV, mini-refrigerator and walk-in shower. Step onto your private balcony for beautiful views over the sea or hotel pools. We also have suites with a living area and dining table - perfect for families. Dine any time at Hilton Cabo Verde. Enjoy European\\/Asian fusion cuisine and the chill vibe of Bounty Beach Restaurant, and try the fresh and welcoming buffets of Magellan Restaurant. Our pool bar and jazz bar are enticing options each day, and room service is available 24 hours. You'll find a wealth of facilities in the hotel including a casino, spa and beauty salon. Take a dip in our huge pools or visit the nautical centre for diving and sailing adventures. We also have tennis courts, a 24-hour fitness centre, a convenience shop, business center and gift shop. From small meetings up to lavish weddings, we have the attractive event spaces to make your event shine. Abundant natural light and state-of-the-art projectors and sound systems will enhance your event."
