_:n4f1ee77e70764c48a752ca50ab7bfcffxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Falcon Naama Star features an outdoor pool, hot tub and a restaurant serving regional specialities made from fresh local ingredients. It is less than 5 minutes\\u2019 walk to Viva Beach. All rooms are spacious and airy and are decorated in beige hues. Each one is fitted with a TV, air conditioning and a well-stocked minibar. Light snacks, tropical cocktails and non-alcoholic beverages are served at Falcon Naama Star\\u2019s terrace bar. Warm drinks and salads are available in the hotel\\u2019s cosy caf\\u00E9. The hotel organises regular music shows and live folk music in the evenings. For a quiet day in, guests can enjoy a game of table tennis or billiards in the games room. Hotel Falcon Naama Star is 12 km from Sharm el Sheikh Airport. It is less than 5 minutes\\u2019 walk from Naama Bay\\u2019s main shopping streets."
