_:n0590214ddef0475b8cfb3d385ca137a1xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Grand Mirage Resort & Thalasso Bali is situated on the tip of Tanjung Benoa\\u2019s Nusa Dua Beach. It has an award-winning restaurant, pool with swim-up bar, and water sports facilities. Free WiFi is provided. Rooms at Grand Mirage offer beautiful ocean views. Each room is equipped with an LCD TV, safety deposit box and tea\\/coffee maker. Bathrooms have a separate bathtub and shower, with shutters opening into the bedroom. Grand Mirage Resort & Thalasso provides a large variety of on-site activities for guests, such as Balinese cooking lessons and guided bicycle tours. Guests can also make use of water sports equipment. Cultural evening programmes feature bonfires, traditional dances, games and themed buffets. The Grand Caf\\u00E9, open 24 hours a day, offers an Asian and international menu as well as dinner buffets. Fresh seafood and barbecue dishes can be sampled at Jukung Restaurant, located on the beach. Grand Mirage Resort & Thalasso Bali is a 20-minute drive from Benoa Harbour. It is a 15-minute drive from Ngurah Rai International Airport. Kuta Beach is a 15-minute drive away."
