_:n4a689bb8c39143a181d944c8f365c063xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located on the Southeastern coast of Bali, The Sakala Resort Bali CHSE Certified boasts two extensive outdoor pools, spa, fitness center, kids club and an all-day restaurant by the beach. Suites in this resort blend modern interiors with traditional Balinese touches. Free WiFi is accessible throughout the property. Whilst our accommodation is not on the beach side, across a small road where our security assists guests crossing, there is the iconic Sakala Beach Club right on the beachfront with an outdoor infinity pool, sun lounges, pool bar, and an all-day dining restaurant offering international cuisine and Asian delights. The Lobby Bar specializes in Bali-inspired cocktails and light snacks. Fitted with air conditioning and wooden flooring, spacious suites each feature a kitchenette, dining area and a living area with cushions. Amenities include 42-inch flat-screen cable TVs and bath amenities. Sakala Beach Club is located on the beachfront, offering international cuisines, while Asian delights are served at the restaurant by the main pool. The Lobby Bar specialises in Bali-inspired cocktails and light snacks. Samuh Beach House is our newest beach house that boasts white sands and tranquil waves located only 7-minutes away from our hotel and the Nusa Dua complex. Equipped with relaxing long deck chairs overlooking the ocean, guests are also able to walk over to the shack bar that serves a variety of snacks and beverages or through the beach walk surrounding Nusa Dua for several kilometers. Contrasting from the energetic water sports-centric Tanjung Benoa beach in front of our resort, Samuh Beach offers the alternative\\u2014a serene ambience where you are able to swim (when the tides permit) in the crystal blue waters of the ocean. To ease transportation, we offer a daily shuttle schedule every day to take guests to and from Samuh Beach."
