_:n1b62d3f9a96f410fa22241d4375f7650xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Set on 15 acres of natural bush-land and native gardens and just 2 km from the beach, Avoca Beach Hotel & Resort is offers 2 swimming pools, a tennis court, 3 function rooms, barbecue facilities and a restaurant. Free WiFi is available in public areas. Avoca Beach Hotel & Resort has both motel-style rooms and self-contained options. The villas have high ceilings with exposed wooden beams and boast fully equipped kitchens. The 2-storey terrace apartments have an expansive contemporary design and each bedrooms has a built-in wardrobe. The standard rooms include private balconies and the deluxe rooms are renovated with modern furnishings and private courtyards. You can dine at the Saltwater Bistro and The Sports Bar, which offers both indoor and alfresco dining. Live entertainment is provided every Friday and Saturday night and the Sports Bar has a media wall covering a range of sporting channels. The Bottle-mart stocks a range of beers, wines, spirits and soft drinks along with ice-creams and snacks."
