_:n2e9cfb7f5d424d10a1eb6cb2794d2604xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Aman is delighted to announce the launch of its first city property and the 27th in the portfolio \\u2013 Aman Tokyo. Occupying the top six floors of the recently-built Otemachi Tower, Aman Tokyo is a luxury resort in Japan and an urban sanctuary high above the atmospheric whirl of tradition and modernity that epitomises Tokyo. Recognised as one of the world\\u2019s Global Cities alongside New York and London, Tokyo is an exciting, vibrant destination. History, commerce and culture fuse in this mega-metropolis that is truly cosmopolitan, yet intrinsically Japanese, offering fascinating juxtapositions at every turn. Access to Aman Tokyo from Metro stations: Underground pathways connecting to the hotel building and the Tokyo Metro Otemachi stations will be closed. We kindly ask guests to access from subway pathways, to ascend to street level (1stfloor) and enter the hotel from our main entrance on the 1st floor."
