_:n406f51666d6e479181b32029d4b08ca9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Featuring restaurants and a children's playground, Bali Paragon Resort Hotel is set in Jimbaran. Guests can enjoy the outdoor swimming pools and on-site bar, while children can enjoy the water slide in the kids' pool. Bali Paragon Resort Hotel is a 5-minute drive from Garuda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park, 6-minute drive from the popular seafood restaurants in Jimbaran Bay and a 10-minute drive from the famed Rock Bar. Ngurah Rai International Airport is a 10-minute drive away. Every room at this hotel is air conditioned and has a 42-inch flat-screen TV. Some rooms include a seating area to relax in after a busy day. You will find tea\\/coffee-making facilities, minibar and a safety deposit box in the room. The en suite bathrooms come with shower facilities and free toiletries. There is a 24-hour front desk with luggage storage facilities. The hotel features a fitness centre and a spa for guests' recreational enjoyment. Other on-site conveniences include laundry service, transportation services and kids' club."
