_:nc97c13725768478cb03d905de78b97d0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Experience the historical heart of Alexandria when you stay at the sumptuous Hilton Alexandria Corniche hotel. Ideally located a short distance from many popular Alexandria attractions, shopping and dining options, this opulent hotel also features a private beach, which can be reached via a complimentary shuttle service. Relax in a stylish guest room or suite at this hotel in Alexandria with thoughtful amenities, including luxurious king-sized beds, WiFi and a balcony. Upgrade to a Garden Floor guest room or suite for beautiful sea and garden views. With a variety of flexible meeting spaces, including an elegant ballroom, this Alexandria hotel is perfect for business meetings and glamorous celebrations. Our team of staff will help to ensure a truly unforgettable event. Enjoy breathtaking sea views from the panoramic swimming pool and rooftop terrace, work out in the modern 24-hour fitness center and treat yourself to a massage in the luxurious wellness facility. Start the day with breakfast in Brasserie La Corniche and enjoy an afternoon cup of coffee in La Gourmandise French Pastry and Tea Lounge. In the evening, dine al fresco as you take in charming views of the Alexandria Sea in Andiamo Pool Terrace or try authentic Levantine cuisine in the sophisticated Sahar El-Laialy. Afterwards, savor your favorite cocktail in The Cigar Bar or dance the night away in the exclusive nightclub, NEO Bar and Lounge."
