_:nc2704d701fc9433ab0ba5bf6a47ff291xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This 17th century, luxury, boutique hotel is the only 4-star hotel in the centre of Lancaster, and is superbly situated in the heart of the city centre. The hotel was originally built in the 17th century and is the oldest bar\\/hotel still operating in Lancaster. With luxurious rooms and comfortable furnishings, the hotel is an ideal base for an upmarket stay in the city. The hotel is situated in the very centre of Lancaster, within yards of the castle and all the city's other attractions. St Martin\\u2019s College (University of Cumbria) and Lancaster University are both an easy commute from the hotel. The hotel regularly welcomes many visiting academics from both institutes."
