_:n61cac6bedec44e659d936e9124db4683xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Retreat to paradise at the Hilton Fiji Beach Resort & Spa and soak up some sun on the 2.5km of beachfront. Everything you need to enjoy a relaxing and indulgent getaway is right at your door. Indulge in sensual and deeply calming spa treatments, take a dip in one of seven pools, or stroll on 2.5km of private beachfront. Feeling more energetic? There are plenty of exciting activities nearby to tempt you, from jet skiing and fishing, to tennis and championship course golf. At the Ika kids\\u2019 club, with daily changing activities, your little ones are guaranteed to have a great time. When the mood takes you, retreat to the adults-only pool and breakfast restaurant. The resort is home to a range of well-appointed guest rooms and elegant suites. Ranging from one to three bedrooms, each has private outdoor living with BBQ, fully equipped kitchenette with espresso machine, living area and laundry. A selection of restaurants offer a range of mouth-watering dining options: chose from international cuisine and traditional Fijian specialties at Nuku restaurant. Savor a pad Thai or nasi goreng on the beachfront while admiring the sunset view at Maravu, where Asian flavors are the specialty. Sample pizza, gelato, light meals and barista coffee the Deli. However you decide to spend your time at Hilton Fiji, you'll always enjoy our famously warm Fijian service, where nothing is too much trouble and the smiles are effortless."
