_:n869d920682664b29bc8836404cb546d2xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Offering free garage parking, Hotel one66 is located in Sankt Gallen, directly at the motorway exit St. Gallen-Winkeln. The hotel offers rooms with a flat-screen TV and a modern bathroom and free Wi-Fi is provided. For your comfort, you will find free toiletries and a hairdryer in every room at this bed and breakfast. A rich breakfast is available every morning at Hotel one66. The Caf\\u00E9Bar serves coffee and drinks in a relaxing atmosphere. Olma Messen St. Gallen is 6.2 km from Hotel one66, while Abbey Library is 5 km from the property. The nearest airport is Zurich Airport, 56 km from Hotel one66. A bus stop is 300 metres away. Guests receive the Mobility Ticket St. Gallen-Bodensee during their stay, including free use of public transport in the city centre and to Lake Constance (fare zone 210, 211 and 231)."
