_:n522c9d03e9814431a1ef9eaf809732f4xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Nestled amongst the bustling street area of Chinatown and South Bridge Road, Heritage Collection on Chinatown - A Digital Hotel offers guests a respite from the buzz in their apartment. Featuring a double glazed door entrance to block out the street noise, Heritage Collection on Chinatown - A Digital Hotel is just a 2-minute walk to Chinatown Heritage Centre and Sri Mariamman Temple and a 5-minute walk to Chinatown MRT Station. Our rooms comes are fully air-conditioned and with modern fittings. Room amenities include a flat Smart TV, and a safety deposit box. The rooms have seating areas and a kitchenette with a portable multipurpose cooker, microwave and an electric kettle. En suite bathrooms feature a standing shower facility. Staff can assist you in English. Plenty of dining options and entertainment, as well as Telok Ayer MRT are within a 10-minute radius from the property. Places of interest are located within the vicinity, including Singapore City Gallery, 5 minutes away, and Marina Bay Sands, 20 minutes away. Changi International Airport is accessible within a 20 km drive."
