_:n8a4e042e83c54157834e6a2d8b4138d0xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Sharm El Sheikh, 1.8 km from Nubian Beach, Magic World Sharm - Club by Jaz features accommodation with an outdoor swimming pool, free private parking, a fitness centre and a garden. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a shared lounge and room service, along with free WiFi. There is a sauna, nightclub and a 24-hour front desk. The rooms are fitted with a flat-screen TV with cable channels, minibar, a kettle, a shower and a wardrobe. Rooms include a safety deposit box and certain rooms have pool views. At the resort, the rooms are equipped with a seating area. Magic World Sharm - Club by Jaz offers a terrace. You can play table tennis, darts and tennis at this 5-star resort, and car hire is available. Nabq Bay Beach is 2.1 km from the accommodation, while Rehana Royal Beach is 2.4 km from the property. The nearest airport is Sharm el-Sheikh International Airport, 12 km from Magic World Sharm - Club by Jaz."
