_:n34e7e8fdd55e43ffb1fb5e8fc2dc0e7exb0	http://schema.org/description	"Blending perfectly into the historic surroundings of the Royal Mile, Hilton Edinburgh Carlton is an iconic element of the city. The building dates back to 1900s and is part of the impressive North Bridge which links Edinburgh\\u2019s Old and New town together, giving you easy access to countless shopping, dining and entertainment. Once one of Edinburgh\\u2019s top department stores, the building was fully refurbished in 2016 to bring the d\\u00E9cor back to its stylish best. Our modern rooms offer complimentary WiFi, ergonomic work area and Suite Dreams by Serta\\u00AE beds with luxurious linens. Select an executive room or suite for extra space and amenities including access to the Executive Lounge, with complimentary breakfast and refreshments throughout the day. Savor succulent steaks along with a variety of timeless classics at Marco Pierre White Steakhouse Restaurant, boasting a relaxed ambience with a glamorous interior. For an indulgent afternoon tea and a vast bar menu, pop into our stylish lounge and bar area. 24-hour room service is also available. Work in the business center with secretarial services and complimentary WiFi before re-energizing in the hotel\\u2019s fitness room. Hilton Edinburgh Carlton features seven meetings rooms, all located on the first floor with natural daylight. Host an informal reception for up to 300 guests or a wedding for up to 180, with panoramic city views as a breathtaking backdrop. The feature staircase creates some of the best wedding photography in the city."
