_:n6da472c960a840e89ed2c70697e32a9exb0	http://schema.org/description	"Escape to the geographical heart of England, innovative and stylish Hilton at St George's Park is nestled in The National Forest located 6 miles from Burton upon Trent and just 35 minutes from East Midlands Airport. This unique hotel is within close proximity of the M1, M6 and M42 motorway links. All the tastefully decorated Guest Rooms and Suites feature large windows, comfortable workspace with ergonomic chairs as well as relaxing bathrooms with separate baths and showers. WiFi access is available complimentary throughout the hotel. Hold a conference, team building or social event in one of the 13 flexible meeting rooms, 90 seat Lecture Theatre or book The Ballroom for up to 400 guests. The hotel provides the latest state-of-the-art meeting technology and has 350 free car parking spaces. Sip cocktails in the bar or savor international and local specialties in our all-day dining restaurant. Work out in the health club, unwind using the indoor swimming pool or spoil yourself with one of many beauty treatments to choose from. We offer guests a small-sided pitch for football, and jogging trails. Visit the tranquil natural scenery of the immediate surrounding areas or seek out the thrills on offer in nearby Alton Towers and Drayton Manor Theme parks."
