_:n1fc409335c0b46ed8fb590311b4d4ba8xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Just 400 metres from the beach, Jaz Makadi Saraya offers rooms with a private furnished balcony. It features outdoor heated pools. Guests can spend the day on magnificent Makadi's 18-hole Golf Course, one of the largest in the region with fully stocked Pro Shop. The air-conditioned rooms at Jaz Makadi Saraya have satellite TV, a minibar, and an en suite bathroom. Jaz Makadi Saraya offers a selection of buffet and \\u00E0 la carte restaurants serving traditional Egyptian and international dishes. Feel light and beautiful with the Mividaspa, which includes offers reviving and reinvigorating treatments, massages, sauna, steam, relaxation programs and beauty services with an added charge. Alternatively, Guests can enjoy water sport facilities, diving, snorkeling, canoeing, fishing and horse riding with an added charge. Enjoy while your children having fun at the mini club or you can get your babysitting service with an added charge. Nearby Souk Makadi offers numerous retail outlets, restaurants, and bars. The beach offers a wide variety of water sports. Jaz Makadi Saraya Resort is 3 km away from Makadi Water World Aqua Park with 50 different slides for adults and kids excitement in an added charge."
