_:n7525f758f00f4967a7043264fd2e0781xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Hilton Liverpool City Centre hotel offers award-winning service located within the fashionable Liverpool ONE development, less than 20 minutes from Liverpool John Lennon Airport. Enjoy access to Liverpool\\u2019s wonderful attractions and spectacular views over the city. Guest rooms, suites, deluxe and executive rooms at this Liverpool all offer wonderful views from the floor to ceiling windows, wireless internet access, LCD TV and spacious desk with comfortable work chair. Deluxe and Executive rooms include access to the Executive Lounge offering complimentary continental breakfast. With separate lounge, work and dining areas, Executive Lounge access, and breathtaking views over the city of Liverpool, Suites offer the ultimate in comfort and relaxation. A prime city center location, eight flexible meeting rooms and a board room supported by an experienced events team, makes this Merseyside hotel perfect for corporate functions, prestigious award ceremonies and elegant Liverpool weddings. Stay in touch with a business center and WiFi access in the rooms and public areas and stay fit in the fully equipped fitness center. The contemporary Exchange restaurant boasts beautiful views of Chavasse Park, sumptuous seasonal cuisine for breakfast, lunch or dinner and elegant, stylish surroundings. Popular Liverpool bar, Pima, offers live entertainment, a relaxed sociable ambience and an outdoor terrace."
