_:nec1f874728624d15a7f93078c8edb9b4xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Nestled within a 10-minute drive from the Kirchberg Quarter and LuxAirport, the DoubleTree by Hilton Luxembourg is a haven surrounded by lush forest and green landscapes. This unique location offers the tranquility of nature while offering easy access to the city's vibrant activities, which are only 7-minutes away. Featuring 345 well-appointed rooms and 16 versatile meeting spaces, the DoubleTree by Hilton Luxembourg stands as the perfect choice for your residential conferences or special events such as weddings, communions, christenings, or birthdays. With an ample 250 on-site parking spaces, everyone can seamlessly join the event without any hassle. Take a moment to unwind in our state-of-the-art fitness room or heated indoor swimming pool before indulging in the comfort of our recently renovated bedrooms. The DoubleTree by Hilton Luxembourg provides a harmonious blend of serene surroundings and modern amenities, creating an ideal retreat for both business and leisure travelers."
