_:n7d90b6959da04e7bb0542a2e7d0d48fcxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Adults only luxury resort, The Bale Nusa Dua by LifestyleRetreats in Nusa Dua, presents exclusive villas with private pools and plush day beds. Free Wi-Fi, 2-way airport shuttle service and 24-hour butler services are provided. A 5-minute drive from Bali Collection Nusa Dua, The Bale Nusa Dua by LifestyleRetreats is a 10-minute drive from Bumbu Bali Restaurant and a 15-minute drive from Bali's Ngurah Rai International Airport. Exceptionally spacious and fully air conditioned, villas feature flat-screen TV and MP3 player. Each villa's poolside pavilion come with a large day bed where guests may enjoy ocean breezes and a massage. The Bale Nusa Dua by LifestyleRetreats's spa features a relaxing menu of body and face treatments, while the well-equipped fitness centre ensures a refreshing workout. The resort also provides private yoga rooms and a quiet library. Faces Restaurant has an open kitchen serving delicious Continental fare, while delicious organic cuisine is available at Bliss Restaurant. The poolside Fluid Bar & Lounge provides a casual setting to enjoy drinks, and Tapa Bistro serves cocktails and tapas-style dishes from around the world."
