_:nf7b39a38c2ea447d8a1127aab42d1e8dxb0	http://schema.org/description	"A modern dream in a centuries-old playground. Welcome to the Hampton by Hilton-Bursa, TR. The Hampton by HiltonTM Bursa hotel greets guests with an ultra-stylish triangular shape and a location in the heart of this vibrant, exciting, and historic city. Whether you\\u2019re here for business, leisure, or a little of both, our hotel in Bursa offers a comfortable place to relax and unwind as you experience the area\\u2019s rich cultural heritage and stunning natural beauty. As one of the early capitals of the Ottoman Empire, Bursa offers a treasure trove of historical buildings, museums, mosques, as well as art and architecture from a bygone era. Bursa Archaeological Museum contains work dating back to the Bronze Age. For outdoor adventurers, the stunning Uludag Mountains, or in ancient times \\\"Mount Olympus,\\\" is just 45 minutes away from our Bursa, Turkiye hotel. Take the cable car up to the peaks or enjoy excellent skiing during the winter. When it\\u2019s time to take care of business, you\\u2019ll be close to the city center, the business district, and the Inter City Highway, which offers easy access to the cities of Ankara, Istanbul, and Izmir. Discover a modern dream in a centuries-old playground at the Hampton by Hilton Bursa hotel. At Hampton by Hilton, we offer a broad range of services and amenities to make your stay exceptional, including a free hot breakfast and free hi-speed internet access."
