_:ncbc45edf77fa437ebc3ed68589dc5b8dxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Experience unique resort-style hotel accommodation at the Chateau on the Park \\u2013 Christchurch, a DoubleTree by Hilton. Nestled in 5 acres of tranquil surroundings, amongst gorgeous landscaped gardens, our hotel offers a welcome retreat for both leisure and corporate guests. Just minutes away from Westfield Riccarton mall, the CBS Arena and Addington Business District, it is the perfect hotel for your stay in Christchurch, South Island. Christchurch International Airport is located approximately 6 kilometers away. We boast nearly 200 splendid guest rooms and suites complete with bath, shower, WiFi and HDTV with Sky TV channels. Take in beautiful garden views from a Deluxe room, stretch out in the separate living room of a suite, or treat yourself to a stay in our truly sumptuous, third-floor Presidential Suite, complete with a self-contained kitchen and dining area with private balcony. Wonderful family-friendly facilities include an outdoor swimming pool, putting green and tennis court (golf clubs and tennis rackets are available to hire). Picnic hampers and in-room movies are also available for purchase. Hagley Park golf course, Christchurch Botanic Gardens, Canterbury Museum, Christchurch Art Gallery and Canterbury University are all within a 15 minutes' walk of our hotel. The Chateau on the Park - Christchurch is one of the most popular venues in Christchurch to hold a conference or event, providing free off-street parking and excellent cuisine. Whether you require a meeting room for interviews, a midsize function room for corporate seminars or a grand ballroom for a gala event or product launch, we're the smart choice. As well as 7 dedicated indoor conference and event spaces, we have several outdoor areas within our 5-acre property and a team of experienced professionals on hand to personally assist you. There are a number of wedding options to suit your personal requirements and no hidden costs when you book a wedding package with us. The Baronial architecture, award-winning gardens and the wedding gazebo provide the perfect photographic backdrop for an outdoor wedding ceremony, while the poolside courtyard is ideal for pre-dinner cocktails during the warmer months. Enjoy a comfortable night\\u2019s sleep in one of our suites, a delicious breakfast the following morning in the Garden Court Brasserie, and be welcomed back to savor a romantic dinner for two on your first wedding anniversary. Whether you are visiting Christchurch, New Zealand for business or pleasure, the peaceful garden retreat of the Chateau on the Park - Christchurch, a DoubleTree by Hilton will provide all you need and a warm DoubleTree by Hilton cookie awaits your arrival."
