_:n3b6d542a6f9e459db6d2656d741ad61bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Treat yourself to a stay in one of the 30 guestrooms, featuring heated floors. Wired and wireless Internet access is complimentary, while DVD players and satellite programming provide entertainment. Conveniences include safes and desks, as well as phones with free local calls.Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages, body treatments, and facials. If you're looking for recreational opportunities, you'll find an indoor pool, a spa tub, and a sauna. This hotel also features complimentary wireless Internet access, gift shops\\/newsstands, and wedding services.Featured amenities include complimentary wired Internet access, complimentary newspapers in the lobby, and dry cleaning\\/laundry services. Planning an event in Hoerstel? This hotel has facilities measuring 2368 square feet (220 square meters), including conference space. Guests may use a train station pick-up service for a surcharge, and free valet parking is available onsite.Located in Hoerstel, Parkhotel Surenburg is in a rural location, a 1-minute drive from Suren Castle and 9 minutes from NaturaGart. This 4.5-star hotel is 6 mi (9.7 km) from Doerenther Cliffs and 6.7 mi (10.8 km) from Von-Bodelschwingh-Krankenhaus.Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. Suren Castle - 0.1 km \\/ 0.1 mi NaturaGart - 7.4 km \\/ 4.6 mi Doerenther Cliffs - 9.7 km \\/ 6 mi Von-Bodelschwingh-Krankenhaus - 10.8 km \\/ 6.7 mi Klinikum Ibbenb\\u00FCren - 11.3 km \\/ 7 mi City Museum - 11.5 km \\/ 7.1 mi Motorcycle Museum - 16.6 km \\/ 10.3 mi NaturZoo Rheine - 17.9 km \\/ 11.1 mi Game Reserve Noettler Berg - 18.1 km \\/ 11.3 mi Hollich Mill - 23 km \\/ 14.3 mi Old Town Hall - 24.6 km \\/ 15.3 mi City Museum - 25.3 km \\/ 15.7 mi Steinfurt Castle - 26.1 km \\/ 16.2 mi Badesee Haddorf - 30.9 km \\/ 19.2 mi Haddorfer See - 31.2 km \\/ 19.4 mi The preferred airport for Parkhotel Surenburg is M\\u00FCnster (FMO-M\\u00FCnster - Osnabrueck Intl.) - 23.4 km \\/ 14.5 mi Enjoy a meal at the restaurant, or stay in and take advantage of the hotel's room service (during limited hours). Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar\\/lounge. A complimentary buffet breakfast is served daily from 7:00 AM to 11:00 AM.The property is closed between April 7 and April 18.Hotelstars Union assigns an official star rating for properties in Germany. This property is rated 4 star Superior and is displayed on this page as 4.5 stars.Pets allowed. Only dogs and cats are allowed. Maximum number of pets per room 1. Service animals are allowed. Service animals are exempt from fees\\/restrictionsCar required"
