_:n0844389ae5e54eacae79c16241ba1ad7xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Featuring 3 swimming pools including breathtaking infinity pool, the all-inclusivePickalbatros Citadel Resort Sahl Hasheesh offers rooms with panoramic Red Sea views. The hotel provides 6 private hot tubs and a state-of-the-art fitness centre. The resort is built with natural coral stones which has been hand chiseled from nearby mountains. Hotel offers 4 outdoor pools (3 for adults and 1 for kids) 2 of them are heated during winter. Hotel offers WIFI in the entire property. Beachfront location with private beach. Each spacious and luxuriously appointed guest room features spectacular sea views. The intimate guest rooms are fitted with flat-screen TVs and minibars. Each is equipped with a work desk and air conditioning. Free wired internet is available in all rooms. All rooms feature balcony or terrace. All rooms feature a safety box and minibar The resort is a beachfront location with private beach, and has a marina and private beach extending to 1.6 km long. Pickalbatros Citadel Resort Sahl Hasheesh also offers free land and non-motorized water sports. The international animation team organizes daily activities. Hotel offer Modern gym equipped with cardio vascular equipment. Hotel offer 6 restaurants including Oriental & Asian Cuisines Hurghada city centre is 20 km away, as is Hurghada International Airport. Free private parking is possible on site."
