_:n3d0b28db662048f39e309115f8cfe5e9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Beach spa retreat walking distance from Kuta Square Catch some rays at the nearby beach or spend the day relaxing at Hard Rock Hotel Bali's full-service spa. Then enjoy a meal at one of the hotel's 4 restaurants. Hard Rock Hotel Bali offers 418 air-conditioned accommodations with minibars and espresso makers. 42-inch LED televisions come with satellite channels. Bathrooms include showers with rainfall showerheads, bathrobes, slippers, and complimentary toiletries. Guests can surf the web using the complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks, safes, and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and hair dryers. Housekeeping is provided daily. 2 outdoor swimming pools and 2 spa tubs are on site. In addition to a children's pool, other recreational amenities include a complimentary water park, a sauna, and a fitness center. Children under 17 years old are not allowed in the fitness facility without adult supervision. Guests under 17 years old are not allowed in the fitness facility. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply."
