_:n88450407852645208a8af8c024c56d5bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Mandarin Oriental, Macau is located on the Peninsula, a 5-minute drive from A-Ma Temple and Senado Square. Featuring a 25-metre heated outdoor pool overlooking South China Sea, this 5-star hotel also has a luxurious spa with a variety of therapies and treatments. Free parking is available on site. Directly connected to One Central Macau, Mandarin Oriental, Macau is within walking distance of a wide selection of high-end to high-street shopping options. It is a 5-minute drive from the Ruins of St. Paul's, Senado Square or Macau Fisherman's Wharf. Macau International Airport is a 30-minute drive away. Elegantly designed and decorated, spacious guestrooms offer views of the Nam Van Lake, Macau Tower or the Taipa Island. Each room features air conditioning, a flat-screen cable TV and tea\\/coffee making facilities. Private bathroom comes with a walk-in shower and offers a hairdryer, slippers and free toiletries. The Spa at Macau Mandarin Oriental feature massages and spa treatments in 8 private rooms and couple suites. The hotel also has a fitness centre and sauna facilities. Vida Rica Restaurant & Bar serves a variety of Chinese and Western dishes. Light refreshments and afternoon tea can be enjoyed at the Lobby Lounge."
