_:n68f74935b915462f87583b61332f3784xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated directly opposite Flinders Street Station, in Melbourne\\u2019s dynamic central business district, DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Melbourne \\u2013 Flinders Street is within walking distance of many major corporate offices, and the dining and entertainment precincts of South Bank and Federation Square. Explore the meandering cobblestone alleyways of Melbourne Laneways - home to unique boutiques, art galleries and eclectic cafes and bars. Enjoy easy access to Melbourne attractions including Collins Street and Etihad Stadium. Unwind in a stylish and modern guest room, equipped with amenities designed to help you feel at home. Lie back on the signature Sweet Dreams\\u00AE by DoubleTree bed while you browse channels on the flat-screen HDTV. Check emails with WiFi (fee applies), work in comfort at the large ergonomic desk, and luxuriate in the spacious bathroom. The onsite restaurant serves tempting Australian and international specialties for breakfast, lunch and dinner, and the relaxed Lobby Lounge Bar is the ideal place to enjoy a coffee or a glass of wine. Maintain your exercise routine with contemporary equipment in the complimentary 24-hour Fitness Center. Ensure that your meeting, conference, or wedding is a successful one by holding it at our Melbourne hotel. There are three flexible meeting spaces available, and our friendly, professional team is always on hand to help. Fax or print documents in the complimentary 24-hour business center, and take advantage of the latest A\\/V technology. Feel welcome the moment you arrive at our hotel in Melbourne with a signature DoubleTree chocolate chip cookie at check-in."
