_:n039f36e7160c4080891a13af415aed09xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located in the heart of Melbourne CBD, Hilton Melbourne Little Queen Street is a short walk from all major shopping precincts and tourist attractions in the area. Situated on what was once the Equity Chambers, constructed in 1931, our historic hotel offers 244 rooms, with 10 suites located at the front of the hotel facing Bourke Street. Suites include a separate living space and large Smart TVs. Our stylish hotel offers 5 meeting rooms, ideal for board meetings and small conferences for up to 100 guests. Enjoy a sumptuous breakfast of freshly baked bread, house baked muffins and pastries each morning. For lunch and dinner, dine on delicious Australian meets European cuisine in our friendly restaurant. When you're ready to unwind, visit our vibrant Bourke St Bar, a bright and whimsical space offering delicious cocktails and a vintage vibe."
