_:n044dcec0e6cc461bbe627adbc9a206fcxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Enjoy an elegant stay in our historic 19th century building at Chekhoff Hotel Moscow, Curio Collection by Hilton. Dating back to 1891, our property was once a favorite of famed Russian writer Anton Chekhov, and exudes an eclectic blend of modern d\\u00E9cor and traditional charm. Our central Moscow location places you close to attractions including Red Square and Bolshoi Theatre. Relax in your bright, modern guest room, offering a work desk with docking station, tea and coffee-making facilities, bottled water and an orthopedic bed. Upgrade to a suite to enjoy stunning city views, a separate living area and two bathrooms. Work out in our contemporary gym, then reward yourself with a cocktail from our glamorous hotel bar. Our restaurant provides a full buffet breakfast and an a la carte menu with an inviting wine list. Room service is available 24-hours, so you can dine in the comfort of your room or suite. Our Moscow city center hotel offers space for up to 30 guests for celebration dinners or meetings, with A\\/V equipment available. If you need anything throughout your stay, our dedicated staff aim to provide a personalized service tailored to your requirements."
_:n044dcec0e6cc461bbe627adbc9a206fcxb0	http://schema.org/name	"Chekhoff Hotel Moscow, Curio Collection by Hilton"
