_:n74efb4f3b82340718291031c21fda195xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Welcome to Hilton Garden Inn Novorossiysk, a modern waterfront hotel located in the heart of the city on the beautiful Black Sea coast. Part of a premium multifunctional complex, our hotel is walking distance to shops, major city attractions and the beach, and two kilometers from the country's main seaport. Take in spectacular views of the Cape of Love, overlooking the Tsemes Bay, while sipping on a cocktail on our rooftop bar. Make yourself comfortable in a spacious guest room equipped with complimentary WiFi, desk with ergonomic chair, HDTV, mini-fridge and a Suite Dreams\\u00AE by Serta bed. Our hotel offers convenient, on-site amenities including a restaurant, both indoor and outdoor swimming pools, bar, wellness zone with fitness room and massage rooms, business centre and 750 square meters of event space."
