_:n70e44bd7f40541208fcc7ec1aa49e17bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Footsteps from Palmanova beach, FERGUS Bermudas has a large garden with outdoor pool. Relax with the entertainment program and dine in the restaurant before heading to the bar. Enjoying an exotic position on the stunning island of Majorca, this hotel has a sunny, tropical feel with a privileged position near the beach and a design which makes the most of its surroundings. All bedrooms have private balconies where you can breathe the fresh sea air and soak up the Majorcan sunshine. Browse the nearby shops, bars and restaurants of Palmanovas centre and take the short stroll down to the beach for a swim in the Mediterranean and admire gorgeous sea views. Have fun taking part in the day and night entertainment programme. Kids will have fun and make new friends in the childrens miniclub. This hotel features 10.000 square metres of lush gardens. There is free private parking on site."
