_:n205932173c48409a86944e763a81a240xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Say hello to Paris. Ideally located close to the main historical and cultural attractions of the capital, our vibrant neighborhood hotel offers a local, elegant experience. Located in Paris' 16th arrondissement, we're within two kilometers of the Arc de Triomphe, Eiffel Tower, Trocadero Gardens, Champs-Elysees, and Bois de Boulogne. Trocadero Metro Station is just 210 meters away. Enjoy a breathtaking view of the Eiffel Tower and the famous toits de Paris on our rooftop terrace."
