_:n42610996c70a45f0b3d4d27cd7bf4ba5xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Boasting 100 years of history, this family-run hotel in Rostock\\u2019s Warnem\\u00FCnde district offers a wide range of wellness services, restaurants and shops. The Hotel Am Alten Strom is located directly on the waterfront, within easy reach of the railway station and numerous leisure facilities. Visit the hotel\\u2019s Wellness-Vital-Thalasso-Center and treat yourself to invigorating massages and spa treatments. The comfortably equipped rooms include free WiFi access. They are all served by a lift and some additionally by some stairs. Suites are accessible via a stairway. The \\\"Restaurant am Strom\\\", our Lobby-Bar \\\"Zur Galeone\\\" and the Mahlwerk will treat you to delicious specialties and beverages."
