_:n9f342ede56fc43e984a5865a86e4f535xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The newly opened Hilton Tashkent City hotel offers modern comfort and excellent connections to local attractions. Located only 15 minutes from Tashkent International Airport, our comfortable rooms and suites are suitable for a wide variety of guests. Settle into our brand new guest rooms and suites, featuring stunning views of the city. Refresh in the spacious bathroom, then simply unwind with WiFi and a 55-inch HDTV. Our stunning Presidential Suites offer extra space, classic d\\u00E9cor and a mini-bar. Our Tashkent City hotel is situated in a great location for exploring local attractions. Visit Chorsu Bazaar, a traditional open-air market selling a range of goods, only 10 minutes\\u2019 drive away. Soak in the local culture and explore a range of historical artifacts at the State Museum of History of Uzbekistan. Take a trip to the Art Gallery of Uzbekistan, a beautifully modern building with a wide art collection, situated within walking distance of our hotel. Onsite we have a range of dining options, including all day dining, a lobby bar and a Pan Asian Restaurant located on the 21st floor. Relax and indulge in some of the finest dishes in the city with a panoramic view of the skyline."
_:n9f342ede56fc43e984a5865a86e4f535xb0	http://schema.org/name	"Hilton Tashkent City"
