_:n95159e034faa428ebdf1bce1ebcd710cxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Situated in Playa de Muro, Iberostar Selection Albufera Playa has a Spa, tennis court, 2 paddle courts and 7 swimming pools. (one of them indoor) Each air-conditioned room includes a balcony. Free WiFi is available in the property. Iberostar Selection Albufera Playa is near S\\u2019Albufera Natural Park, in Mallorca\\u2019s Alc\\u00FAdia Bay. The resort of Ca\\u2019n Picafort is just 3 km away. All rooms at Iberostar Selection Albufera Playa feature a flat-screen TV with satellite channels and a minibar. The bathrooms include a shower, hairdryer and a mirror. The hotel is part of a resort made up of two hotels that share 7 swimming pools (one of them indoor), 10 restaurants and bars and activities. Offers live music, shows and activities for all ages. The property includes an indoor pool, a hot tub, sauna and a gym. The port of Alcudia is 7 km from Iberostar Selection Albufera Playa."
