_:n4c4eab02665544159314cd946a38f58bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"HARRIS Sunset Road is located a 15-minute drive from Ngurah Rai Airport and the Seminyak Area. It offers a restaurant, an outdoor pool and free Wi-Fi in public areas and some rooms. Air-conditioned guest rooms are fitted with tea\\/coffee making facilities, a personal safe and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. The en suite bathroom comes with toiletries and shower. HARRIS Hotel & Residences Sunset Road is a 15-minute drive from Legian Beach, the Sanur area and Bali Galeria Mall. The hotel has a business centre for guests\\u2019 convenience. Guests can swim at the outdoor pool or enjoy a relaxing moment at the hotel\\u2019s lounge. A children's club is also available. The on site restaurant serves international and Indonesian dishes. We offer free shuttle from hotel to Mal Bali Galeria, Lippo Plaza, Beachwalk (on schedule)"
