_:nebbee9b172fa4cb6afc397e70c3fd302xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Elevate trips to Bali, Indonesia, at Fairfield Bali South Kuta. Our hotel is 10 minutes from the international airport. Find us within walking distance of Jerman Beach and many shops and restaurants in South Kuta, or visit popular Bali attractions like Waterbom Bali waterpark, Kuta Art Center, Lippo Mall Kuta and the Discovery Shopping Mall. Ask about our current hotel offers and delight in amenities like 24 hour reception, free WiFi and limited on-site parking. Maintain your fitness routine in our hotel's rooftop pool and 24-hour fitness center. Try our hotel breakfast or stop by Derys Restaurant, a casual sports bar, for Asian and Western specialties any time of day. Head up to the Cabana Pool and Sky Bar for beers, cocktails and light bites on the rooftop. Host events for 50 guests in our hotels modern meeting space. Then retire to one of 71 rooms and suites with modern decor, flat-screen TVs, air conditioning and coffee makers. Select rooms include a balcony for memorable stays in South Kuta, Bali."
