_:n8ebcf2b5939c491cb506ea9ef9368786xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Set on the west coast of Egypt\\u2019s Red Sea, the luxurious, Hilton Marsa Alam Nubian Resort offers a stunning beachfront location with captivating views and a wealth of sailing and diving experiences in the world famous reef of Abu Dabab Bay. All of the spacious Guest Rooms and Suites at this contemporary resort in Marsa Alam feature, private balconies with beautiful views, elegant bathrooms and the signature Hilton Serenity Bed Experience. Food lovers will be spoiled for choice at this Marsa Alam resort, where you can enjoy Middle Eastern specialties and international favorites in Marsa Restaurant, relax with an Arabic coffee and a tempting pastry in the exotic Souk Caf\\u00E9 or sip cocktails while you soak up the sunshine in Breezes Pool Bar. Work out in our complimentary Fitness Center, enjoy a dip in one of 4 outdoor swimming pools, or spend an afternoon soaking up the sunshine on the soft white sands of the beach, before trying one of the exciting water sports available."
