_:n9cba3d2a7e2d47e098f57571ad57d5b7xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Conveniently located in the city center, close to administrative and business districts as well as major shopping and dining options, Hampton by Hilton Nizhny Novgorod is perfect for business and leisure guests alike. Bus stops are located nearby offering an easy access to local attractions and main city terminals, including Moskovskiy railway station and River Terminal. Boasting modern exterior, our contemporary Nizhny Novgorod hotel features well-appointed guest rooms with free WiFi access, comfy bed and a 32-inch HDTV. Other amenities include a work desk with ergonomic chair, alarm clock radio, tea and coffee making facilities, iron and ironing board. Family rooms are available, equipped with an additional sofa sleeper. Start your day with a hot daily breakfast, included with your stay offering a selection of hot and cold items and freshly baked waffles. Enjoy a light meal in the Lobby bar, grab something tasty from the 24\\/7 hub or stop by the Front Desk for some insider tips on local restaurants and bars. Maintain your exercise routine in the 24-hour fitness center and stay productive in the on-site work zone with WiFi access. This hotel in Nizhny Novgorod features a 78 sq. meter divisible meeting space, ideal for small business meetings and conventions. Friendly service, clean rooms, comfortable surroundings, every time. If you\\u2019re not satisfied, we don\\u2019t expect you to pay. That\\u2019s our commitment and your guarantee. That\\u2019s 100% Hampton\\u2122."
