_:n59d899cb42984ecbb40b1d694ef761f9xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hotel Reisen in The Unbound Collection by Hyatt provides luxury 5-star accommodation in Stockholm. A short walk from Stockholm Palace, it offers modern rooms equipped with free wireless internet access, a mini bar and a private bathroom. This historic hotel provides a number of facilities, including a plunge pool, a sauna and free Wi-Fi. Romance seekers will enjoy the hotel's features like valet parking and massage services. Hotel Reisen in The Unbound Collection by Hyatt's 144 elegant rooms offer tea and coffee making facilities, an in-room safe and a flat-screen TV, plus all the essentials required for a comfortable stay. They are also fitted with a shower, cable\\/satellite channels and a hair dryer. In-house dining options include a restaurant, which is a convenient spot to have a meal. Each evening, guests can enjoy a drink in the lounge bar. Guests are also able to try one of the various bars and restaurants in the local area. Hotel Reisen in The Unbound Collection by Hyatt is conveniently situated for sightseeing in Stockholm, with Stortorget Stockholm just a short stroll away. The Royal Swedish Opera and Kungstradgarden are a 10-minute stroll away."
