_:n8116edd4424a414c9a59cb67775969aexb0	http://schema.org/description	"Nestled in Independence Park with direct access to the beach and the vibrant Tel Aviv promenade, Hilton Tel Aviv boasts a spacious outdoor saltwater pool, five kosher dining options, an authentic Thai spa and salon, a well-equipped fitness center, and a shopping arcade. The hotel offers 393 air-conditioned rooms featuring high-speed WiFi, flat-screen TVs, minibars, hairdryers, coffee or tea facilities, and private balconies with stunning sea views. Each luxurious bathroom is equipped with Crabtree and Evelyn products and plush bathrobes. Additional amenities include 24-hour room dining service, a synagogue available on weekends and holidays, and proximity to Tel Aviv's shopping centers, restaurants and cultural landmarks. Old Jaffa, one of the oldest cities in the world, is just a few kilometers away, while Ben Gurion International Airport is conveniently a 45-minute drive."
