_:n6ee40dec8cb041ac8ffee64d6a3ea775xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Escape to (literally) the heart of downtown at the Metropolitan Hotel Vancouver. Our prime location has the business district, transit, cultural attractions, world-class shopping and Michelin-starred dining at your doorstep. Revel in elevated comfort with our newly-enhanced guestrooms and suites, majority featuring a Juliet or step-out balcony. Embrace being in an urban oasis as you relax in your spacious bathrooms featuring both a shower and bathtub, stay on routine with our 24-hour fitness centre and lounge at our indoor heated pool, open throughout all the seasons. Our family of passionate hoteliers are dedicated to creating exceptional experiences just for you - turning guests into friends, and ordinary moments into remarkable memories. Enjoy the intimacy of a boutique-style experience with the perks of staying loyal to the world's largest hotel chain. Welcome to your home in the city."
