_:nc50c3cba4dfa4630ac2f4f532deb8015xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The family-run Hotel-Pension Bleckmann is only a few steps from the Ringstra\\u00DFe boulevard, Vienna University and the Votive Church. It offers free WiFi and a breakfast buffet. The rooms provide a private bathroom, satellite TV and a desk. All rooms facing the street have sound-proofed windows. Most rooms look onto the courtyard and are very quiet. At an additional cost, guests of the Bleckmann can park their cars in a parking garage opposite the hotel. The closest tram and bus stop is only 100 metres away. The Schottentor Underground Station at the edge of the historic first district of Vienna is only 400 metres away. The Museum Quarter and the Hofburg Palace are 3 underground stops away."
