_:n012f0ab9662a40b8aead9ba50012b002xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Altmann is a well-kept, family-run hotel in the south of Vienna, close to the main motorways and the SCS shopping centre - running trails are also nearby. All rooms come with a 32-inch flat-screen cable TV and a private bathroom with shower. The bus number 250 takes you to the S-Bahn stop Liesing. The Riverside Shopping Centre can be reached within a few stops. One of Europe's largest shopping malls is about a 12-minute drive away. The \\\"Shopping City S\\u00FCd\\\" (SCS) features a wide range of shops, restaurants and leisure options, including a multiplex cinema."
