_:n6c3459a4d4e643789c09b82146503133xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Hotel K\\u00F6nig is only a 12-minute underground ride away from the centre of Vienna. It offers modern rooms, fine cuisine and free WiFi throughout. All rooms in the K\\u00F6nig Hotel have a private bathroom and cable TV. Some rooms are air-conditioned. Typical Austrian specialities and international cuisine are served in the restaurant. Situated only 200 metres from the Simmering stop of the U3 underground line, all sights of Vienna are easily reachable from Hotel K\\u00F6nig."
