_:nf718294a5f9a43a4b82c31dc8f289c99xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Hyatt Regency Dubai se afl\\u0103 \\u00EEn cartierul de patrimoniu, la cel mult 5 minute de mers pe jos de renumitele pie\\u021Be de aur, mirodenii \\u0219i textile. Acest hotel de lux ofer\\u0103 restaurant rotativ, patinoar privat \\u0219i WiFi gratuit. Camerele de lux au mobilier elegant \\u0219i vedere frumoas\\u0103. Unele camere includ zon\\u0103 de relaxare, cu minibar \\u0219i TV prin satelit. Club Olympus Fitness & Spa de la Hyatt Regency ofer\\u0103 sal\\u0103 modern\\u0103 de sport \\u0219i terenuri de tenis. Serviciile de spa includ o gam\\u0103 larg\\u0103 de masaje de relaxare. Hotelul pune la dispozi\\u021Bie restaurantul de pe acoperi\\u0219 Al Dawaar, singurul restaurant rotativ din Dubai. La Miyako pute\\u021Bi s\\u0103 savura\\u021Bi m\\u00E2nc\\u0103ruri din buc\\u0103t\\u0103ria japonez\\u0103 autentic\\u0103. The Kitchen serve\\u0219te m\\u00E2nc\\u0103ruri interna\\u021Bionale. Oaspe\\u021Bii pot s\\u0103 se relaxeze la lounge-ul de karaoke, s\\u0103 urm\\u0103reasc\\u0103 evenimente sportive live la barul sportiv, s\\u0103 savureze o selec\\u021Bie rafinat\\u0103 de b\\u0103uturi sau s\\u0103 opteze pentru via\\u021Ba de noapte renumit\\u0103. Hyatt Regency Dubai - Corniche se afl\\u0103 la 8 km de Aeroportul Interna\\u021Bional Dubai. Sta\\u021Bia de metrou Gold Souq este la doar 7 minute de mers pe jos de hotel sau la c\\u00E2teva minute cu serviciul gratuit de transfer, oferit \\u00EEn func\\u021Bie de disponibilitate."
