_:nda052bd301dc4d4ca54b08c028d6d49axb0	http://schema.org/description	"Set in Warsaw's business district, the Hampton by Hilton Warsaw Airport hotel is only three minutes from the International Chopin Airport on our complimentary shuttle. We\\u2019re six kilometers from the city center, offering easy access to Warsaw attractions. The Old Town, the Warsaw Rising Museum, Galeria Mokotow, and the Royal Castle are all within 10 km. Admire panoramic views of Warsaw from the top of the Palace of Culture and Science and savor traditional Polish cuisine in one of the city's many eateries and in the summer months. Take in an outdoor concert surrounded by peacocks and squirrels in the beautiful Lazienki Park. Relax in your comfortable guest room at this Warsaw hotel, where you can stay connected with free high-speed internet access at the spacious work area. Watch movies on the 32-inch LCD TV as you relax on the comfy bed. Start your day right with a workout in the free, 24-hour fitness center before enjoying Hampton's free hot breakfast. Host an event in Warsaw with our modern 47 sq.m. conference room and stay connected with the free, 24-hour business center. There's always a friendly face and free tea and coffee in the welcoming lobby, should you need advice on what to see and do while you're in Warsaw. Friendly service, clean rooms, comfortable surroundings every time. If you're not satisfied, we don't expect you to pay. That's our commitment and your guarantee. That's 100% Hampton (r)"
