_:n432127bf1ae04526b9860343e700cfd3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"With a garden and terrace overlooking the sea, Hotel ROC Illetas & SPA offers 2 outdoor pools. This 4-star hotel is located in Illetas, on Mallorca\\u2019s south coast, and looks onto Palma Bay and has direct access to the sea. Hotel ROC Illetas & SPA has 4 buildings: Clasico, Adelfas, Mimosa and Buganvilla. The last one is separated from the rest by a public road. Set near clear blue water coves, the accommodation features views of the Mediterranean sea. The air-conditioned rooms feature a private balcony or terrace and satellite TV. They also come with a private bathroom with a hairdryer. Some rooms offer sea views. The restaurant at Hotel ROC Illetas & SPA serves international food. There is also a poolside bar, as well as a caf\\u00E9 with a terrace with fantastic sea views. The hotel has an indoor pool. There is also a free internet corner, TV room, arcade games room and table tennis tables. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. Bendinat Golf Course is just 2,5 Km away from the hotel. You can drive to central Palma in around 15 minutes and buses stop outside the hotel. Parking is available on site for an additional cost."
