_:nf89747185581421e9b7855e4ae97cfc3xb0	http://schema.org/description	"This apartment hotel, a renovated 17th century patrician's house, offers modern, stylish accommodation and a secluded courtyard terrace in the heart of the medieval Altstadt (Old Town) of Dinkelsb\\u00FChl. Free WiFi is included. Look forward to relaxing in your comfortable, well-equipped apartment at the hezelhof hotel. Certain apartments feature a living area with a desk and a flat-screen TV, as well as a bathroom with a bath tub and shower. For a great start to your day, a delicious, complimentary breakfast is provided each morning. Guests are welcome to step outside and relax in the inner courtyard during the warm summer months. The Hezelhof also offers fully equipped conference rooms."
