_:n66a49e6824d1488c9240c25fbdf691bbxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Art Deco hotel with a full-service spa connected to a shopping center in Kuta A full-service spa, a restaurant, and a bar\\/lounge are available at this hotel. Free WiFi in public areas, free self parking, and a free shopping center shuttle are also provided. Other amenities include 2 coffee shops\\/cafes, a snack bar\\/deli, and coffee\\/tea in a common area. Stark Boutique Hotel and Spa Bali offers 88 accommodations, which are accessible via exterior corridors and feature minibars and safes. Each accommodation is individually furnished and decorated. Pillowtop beds feature down comforters. LED televisions come with premium satellite channels. Bathrooms include bathrobes, slippers, and complimentary toiletries. This Kuta hotel provides complimentary wireless Internet access. Business-friendly amenities include desks and phones. Additionally, rooms include complimentary bottled water and coffee\\/tea makers. Housekeeping is offered daily and hair dryers can be requested. The recreational activities listed below are available either on site or nearby; fees may apply."
