_:nae069c477c2c41758551bba3ef96018exb0	http://schema.org/description	"Close to Olympia Exhibition Centre and the fashionable Kensington High Street, Hilton London Olympia is the perfect base for business or leisure. For those looking to host conferences and events, our dedicated events team will work closely with you to understand your needs. Kensington has many nice destinations to visit and things to do for all ages. From historic architecture and stunning art to hands-on activities for kids, we are in the perfect place to see it all. With excellent bus, train and airport connections close by, traveling further afield will not be a problem, which makes us a go-to destination for your next family break. Our rooms are designed with your comfort and convenience in mind, providing a place to unwind or catch up on work. Whether you are here on business or for a city break, we are here to help you make the most of your stay by offering fantastic dining and first-class services. We have everything you need for a truly memorable stay in the capital. Hilton London Olympia Hotel rates are now inclusive of all taxes."
