_:n5d19dd1e2ddc49e28edf5a4146c72679xb0	http://schema.org/description	"The Prince Akatoki offers tranquil accommodation in the heart of London within a short walk from Marble Arch and Hyde Park. The hotel is inspired by the traditions of Japanese hospitality and fuses the best of Japan and the western world to provide guests with a 5-star luxury experience. The rooms are beautifully designed with a minimal aesthetic, natural elements, luxury fabrics and colours. Each of the 82 rooms and suites features plush beds, an extensive range of premium amenities, complimentary WiFi and bathrooms with luxurious rain showers. At The Prince Akatoki, guests can dine at TOKii and enjoy seasonal dishes that feature the best of East and West cuisine. Guests can also indulge in a rare collection of whiskies and Japanese sakes as well as cocktails tailored by the best bartenders in The Malt Lounge and Bar. Marble Arch Underground Station is just a 2-minute walk away, for accessing the famous attractions of the city. Paddington Station is 1.3 km away and offers direct links to Heathrow Airport, via the Heathrow Express."
