_:n7ed4ef9cb1c547b1a932e0ce091f8d8bxb0	http://schema.org/description	"Located right on Montaza Beach, this 5 star resort combines an impressive range of features and facilities. It features a private beach, 2 pools, a kids' pool and club. Jaz Belvedere is 6 KM away from SOHO Square and 13 KM away from the International Congress Center. Styled with touches of traditional Arabian-Moroccan design, the hotel is one of the finest in Sharm El Sheikh. At Belvedere, you can enjoy something very special: warm, individual service, entertainment programs, and diving. Activities can be enjoyed at the resort that includes beach tennis, volleyball court and a multi-purpose court. Guests can enjoy water sport facilities, windsurfing, diving, snorkeling, and canoeing with an added charge. The spa includes reviving treatments, foot-bath, massages, relaxation programs, and beauty services with an added charge. Jaz Belvedere Resort is just 10 km from Sharm El Sheikh International Airport and 20 km from Sharm El Sheikh town centre."
