_:n05c9086460cf4ba78a8c8ef18d98c94axb0	http://schema.org/description	"Lorin Solo Hotel is located in the centre of Solo City, a 10-minute drive from Adisumarmo International Airport and Manahan Stadium. Housing air-conditioned rooms and an outdoor swimming pool, the hotel provides free WiFi throughout the building. Featuring a private terrace with garden views, the rooms come with floor-to-ceiling windows and plenty of natural sunlight. A flat-screen TV, refrigerator and tea\\/coffee maker are included. En suite bathroom provides shower facilities and complimentary toiletries. Solo Grand Mall and Solo Shopping Centre are both a 15-minute drive from Lorin Solo Hotel. The landmarks of Solo, such as Mangkunegaran Royal Palace and Kasunanan Royal Palace are a 20-minute drive from the property. Alternatively, guests can visit Triwindu Antique Market and Batik Village; both are also 20 minutes\\u2019 drive away from Lorin. The hotel\\u2019s 24-hour reception comes with luggage storage facilities and safety deposit boxes. Laundry and dry cleaning services are provided at a cost. A tour desk, car rental and airport pick-up services are also available. Guests can enjoy relaxing massages, or work out at the gym. Sasono Bujono Resto serves continental and Indonesian cuisines, while Kampoeng Ikan Restauran serves seafood dishes and hosts traditional puppet show (Wayang) monthly. Guests can lounge at the Jolotundo Pool Bar or enjoy live music at Pipas Lounge."
