_:n53df9768adc448f88f308fa91625c962xb0	http://schema.org/description	"Luxury spa hotel, a short walk to Taipei Arena 3 restaurants, a full-service spa, and an outdoor pool are available at this smoke-free hotel. Self parking is free. Additionally, a bar\\/lounge, a steam room, and a coffee shop\\/cafe are onsite. Mandarin Oriental, Taipei offers 303 accommodations with DVD players and minibars. Beds feature down comforters and premium bedding. A pillow menu is available. LED televisions come with video-game consoles. Guests can make use of the in-room refrigerators and coffee\\/tea makers. Bathrooms include separate bathtubs and showers with deep soaking bathtubs, bathrobes, slippers, and designer toiletries. In-room wired and wireless Internet access is available for a surcharge. Business-friendly amenities include desks, complimentary newspapers, and phones. Additionally, rooms include safes and complimentary bottled water. A nightly turndown service is provided and housekeeping is offered daily. Amenities available on request include hypo-allergenic bedding. Recreational amenities at the hotel include an outdoor pool and a steam room."
