_:n5fe3d400037e4711833d4d07a765985exb0	http://schema.org/description	"The luxurious Mansion Resort & Spa is located at the foothills of Ubud in Bali. Nestled within zen landscaped grounds, it boasts outdoor pools and hot tubs, organic menus and extensive wellness and beauty treatments. Located in the courtyard or within tropical gardens, each room comes with beautifully designed interiors. They are spacious and well-equipped with air conditioning, a luxurious bathroom and a minibar. All rooms boast fine artworks from local artists. Guests at The Mansion Bali can enjoy fine dining French cuisine at Indochine or sample delicious dishes from an international menu at Caf\\u00E9 La Terrace. It also houses the hotel\\u2019s private art collection. Other options include Jasmine Tea Lounge and Wantilan Bar for drinks. The resort offers a variety of beauty treatments like rejuvenation and spa sessions. To compliment the experience, there are a series of yoga classes and therapeutic massages at the resort. Guests can also play a game of billiard. Located just few minutes drive to the popular Kuta, Seminyak or Sanur area, Mansion Hotel & Spa is a 40-minute drive to Ngurah Rai International Airport. Ubud Market is less than 3 km away."
